          "id": "12b5403c9857a30b12d099e03c817ebf6c53fc23",
          "message": "Add balancing functionality with nalgebra and nnls\n\n* Add functionality to balance composition sets, currently by solving\n  the least squares problem with `nalgebra` SVD, or the non-negative\n  least squares using the `nnls` crate. Add the following methods:\n\n    `balance_compositions_nalgebra`\n    `balance_compositions_nnls`\n\n* Add unit tests with some simple balancing examples, e.g. dairy\n  combinations, as well as tests balancing full reference recipes.\n* Introduce `clippy.toml` suppressing duplicate crate dependency lint\n  warnings for crates introduced purely from dependencies themselves.\n* Add `getrandom` crate with `js` feature enabled to support wasm32\n  targets. This crate is used by some dependencies, not directly.\n* Add some simple preliminary benchmarks for the balancing functions.\n\n@note The balancing feature is WIP, this is just some preliminary\nproof-of-concept support with a very minimal interface, no WASM\nsupport, no testing of failure conditions or performance stops, etc.",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-21T22:45:43-04:00",
          "tree_id": "c5b8542f53be523a180e13b5ac3c521af36bc3a7",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/12b5403c9857a30b12d099e03c817ebf6c53fc23"
