          "id": "8cb337e6fe27a0e8af857fa972ac59e8945041ac",
          "message": "Rename IngredientCompositionGrid; split into 3\n\nRenames `IngredientCompositionGrid` to `CompositionBreakdown*` and\nsplits it into a bare `CompositionBreakdown`, a\n`CompositionBreakdownView` carrying the `RecipeSelect`,\n`QtyToggle`, and `KeyFilter` toolbar, and a\n`CompositionBreakdownPanel` wrapping the grid-layout chrome and\ndrag handle. The bare layer takes a single `Recipe` so future\nsingle-recipe consumers can drop it in directly.\n\nThe `CompositionBreakdown*` naming leaves `CompositionTable` and\n`CompositionView` free for a planned compact per-ingredient sheet\nwith vertical keys, mirroring `PropertiesTable`/`PropertiesView`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
