          "message": "Move `RecipeEditor` tests to where the code lives\n\nMoves the editor-behaviour tests (input handling, copy/paste,\nclear, recipe-select integration, validation styling, datalist,\nWASM interop) from `_components/recipe-editor-panel.test.tsx`\ninto `_elements/tables/recipe.test.tsx`, alongside the existing\n`RecipeTable` tests, and switches the render target from\n`<RecipeEditorPanel>` to `<RecipeEditor>`. Same prop shape, one\nwrapper layer thinner.\n\nLeaves the panel test file with only the three chrome-level\nassertions it actually owns: panel id, grid-component class,\ndrag-handle presence. This matches the pattern used by the other\n`*Panel` test files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
