          "id": "c0b0cdb3fb62286fb8dd6ff6ca0dfac14311efe0",
          "message": "Add `WatchersPanel` to calculator page\n\n- New panel of compact cards, one per selected `PropKey`, showing\n  current/ref values, acceptable range, target input, and refs deltas\n- Header color-coded by value's position in the acceptable range, with\n  refs and target import buttons (fill target from Ref A/B)\n- Selection and targets persisted in `localStorage`\n- Reserves a fixed-height footer slot for the future Balance interface\n- Extract `getRangeColor(value, {min, max})` helper into colors.ts;\n  refactor `PropertiesBarChart` to delegate to it (behavior preserved)\n- Unit tests for `WatcherCard`, `WatchersView`, `WatchersPanel`\n- Visual regression snapshots for empty + 3 populated states\n\n* Change calculator react-grid-layouts to accomodate the new component.\n* Update most visual regression screenshot assets to accomodate these\n  changes - even unaffected components now have different proportions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
