          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4baac9d5c3c6e0220030bb533debe86d1fdd0a18",
          "message": "Expand panel visual tests across recipe subsets\n\nCover the seven non-empty subsets of {Main, RefA, RefB} for\neach panel that filters empty reference columns (Properties,\nPropertiesChart, FpdGraph, Watchers). Drive panel\nregistration through a single loop.\n\nDisplay panels apply `filterActiveSlots`, which always keeps\nthe Main column but drops empty references. The previous\npaste-check used the logical slot index (`recipeIdToIdx`),\nwhich mismatches the rendered column whenever a populated\nreference sits after an empty one -- e.g. RefB renders at\ncolumn 1, not 2, when RefA is empty.\n\nThread an optional `populatedRecipeIds` through the\npaste-check helpers and add `renderedRecipeColumnIdx` to\ntranslate logical slot to rendered column, mirroring\n`filterActiveSlots`.\n\nMove `makeRecipesTestName` / `makeRecipesScreenshotFilename`\nout of `panels.spec.ts` into `visual/assets.ts`, and extract\na `locatePanelAndExpectVisible` helper to dedupe the locate\n+ visible-assertion pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
