          "distinct": true,
          "id": "62ef2ebedbe68ac63f5b08e4c5144425b414c583",
          "message": "Use `#[serde(untagged)]` for key deserilization\n\n* Use `#[serde(untagged)]` in all variants of `BalanceKey` and `PropKey`\n  to allow a flat list of keys in the WASM-facing API, in line with how\n  the TypeScript wrappers handle `PropKey`. This requires that all\n  variant names be unique across all the underlying key types, namely\n  `CompKey`, `RatioKey`, and `FpdKey`.\n* Simplify `balancing_targets_from_js_value` by deserializating the\n  `BalanceKey`s directly now that they support an untagged flat list.",
