          "id": "6d59fe99d479570c7a469f4c74edb147ab95f667",
          "message": "Add `DairySimpleSpec::protein` and `solids_source`\n\n* Add new `protein` and `solids_source` optional fields to\n  `DairySimpleSpec`, to allow specifying more ingredients, e.g. whey\n  solids powders and concentrates. This also follows the fields used in\n  Goff & Hartel tables, which enables direct snapshot comparisons.\n* Add new dairy ingredients from Goff & Hartel, and add them to the\n  existing `dairy::compare_specs_*` tests. Comparing 'Simple' vs. 'Goff\n  & Hartel' is a circular comparison, to some degree, since the standard\n  values come from that book, but it's good to check against a table.",
