          "id": "85b5e1c2be5a117786a31573d31568ca7740c2b0",
          "message": "Move select spacing from selects to parent views\n\n* Select elements, e.g. `QtyToggleSelect`, `KeyFilterSelect`, etc. have\n  a \"mx-1\" for spacing. Remove this and move it up to their parent\n  views, e.g. `PropertiesView`, `RecipeEditor`, etc. as a \"gap-2\". This\n  is a more logical and flexible aproach, and it prevents a left margin\n  on views without a drag handle, e.g. `PropertiesView` in `/recipes`.\n* Unify the duplicated \"flex items-center gap-2\" as `.toolbar` CSS cls.\n* For the most part this refactor does not change the visual layout, so\n  it does not require screenshot updates, except for `/recipes` and\n  `/ingredients` that lose the left margin, and a recipe name shift.",
