          "distinct": true,
          "id": "507699d264e44fc71b26d5d5f25ea2f7b30360dd",
          "message": "Share session resources across app routes\n\nAdd SessionResourcesProvider in the root layout to own the single\nWASM bridge plus the user's saved recipes and ingredient specs,\nfetched once per session and shared across the calculator, recipes,\nand ingredients routes. useSeededWasmResources reads the shared\ntuple from context, and mutation sites refresh the shared caches\nexplicitly.\n\nStop threading wasmResources through props: RecipeEditor and the\nsearch detail panels read it from context directly, since it is a\nsession-wide singleton.\n\nGuard the per-session fetch on the signed-in email (and dispatch the\ningredient fetch first) so a flickering session can't re-fire it, and\nadd an e2e test asserting client-side navigation issues no further\nfetches.\n\nReseed the shared bridge via the OnConflict primitives (clear,\nseed_from_embedded_data, seed_from_specs) from the parent commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-17T18:10:47-04:00",
