          "id": "b0341512283072d151073a666185e9136f4b4952",
          "message": "Add embedded-data integrity test and diagnostics\n\nConsolidate and strengthen validation of the embedded ingredient\ndataset, which was previously only checked implicitly across scattered\ntests.\n\n- Add tests/embedded/integrity.rs: a single test resolving every\n  embedded spec and asserting its composition is valid and\n  structurally consistent, reporting failures by spec name.\n- Add SpecEntry::from_json_value, which parses the concrete variant\n  directly so a malformed entry yields a field-level serde error\n  instead of the untagged \"no variant matched\".\n- Name the offending entry in parse_spec_entries_from_json_string\n  errors, recovered from the raw JSON.\n- Move verify_structural_consistency to tests/util.rs and reuse it\n  from the hierarchy test; add verify_are_equal to validate.rs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-22T00:20:17-04:00",
          "tree_id": "b17fa52f00547c57b846b6816f089895f8f8339d",
