          "id": "40138925ba32abd348fa2affe0e02127a6bd8f8d",
          "message": "Add USDA chocolate refs and compare_specs tests\n\n4 USDA SR Legacy reference ingredients: dark chocolate 45-59%,\n60-69%, 70-85% cacao solids, and unsweetened cocoa powder.\n\nGeneric Cocoa Powder, 13% Fat added as a baseline for the USDA\ncocoa powder comparison.\n\nNew compare_specs tests: compare_specs_chocolate_65 and\ncompare_specs_cocoa_powder_13_fat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-23T12:51:43-04:00",
