          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b7a7b7f1d3a066f2a60645108784adb103b69d8b",
          "message": "Add unified Auto heuristic for PropChart/Watchers\n\n* Implement `makeAutoHeuristicFunction` in sci-cream.ts which is used by\n  both `PropertiesChartView` and `WatchersView`, to maintain a matching\n  selection. The Auto heuristic selects `DEFAULT_SELECTED_PROPERTIES`,\n  filtering any inactive keys. A key is active if it has a non-zero\n  value in any reference recipe or in any ingredient in the main recipe.\n* Consolidate `DEFAULT_SELECTED_PROPERTIES` from `PropertiesChartView`\n  and `WatchersView` into a single exported const in `sci-cream.ts`.\n* Add more key modifiers in `properties-chart.tsx`, now that more keys\n  will be shown in the chart by default, e.g. Alcohol & EggSNF * 10.\n* Promote `getMixScopePropKeys` to a consolidated util in `sci-cream.ts`,\n  and us it in both `PropertiesChartView` and `WaterchersView`.\n* Do not filter out Water & HardnessAt14C, instead use /2 modifiers.\n* Introduce `get_ratio_key_parts`, a WASM forwarder to RatioKey::parts.\n  This is used in `makeAutoHeuristicFunction`, where a ratio key is also\n  active if its numerator and denominator key parts are active.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-25T20:10:44-04:00",
          "tree_id": "01d6334cf177b6a50b286a929202b60830d1419c",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/b7a7b7f1d3a066f2a60645108784adb103b69d8b"
