          "message": "Hide target input/delta for non-balanceable keys\n\nFpdKey cards keep their target input and delta span in the DOM\n(visibility:hidden) so layout doesn't shift, set tabIndex=-1 to skip\nkeyboard focus, and disable the fill-from-ref button. The fill-all\naction in WatchersView now skips non-balanceable keys. Tests cover\nall four surfaces plus the fill-skip behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
