          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b15d412e09dce2384ec289fbee2040ec9e9b2c64",
          "message": "Normalize properties chart onto per-property tracks\n\nReplace the ad-hoc per-key scaling (modifyMixPropertyForChart and its\nlockstep label/range helpers) with normalization: each property is\nself-normalized over the union of its acceptable range, main value,\nreferences, and target, so the acceptable band always lands on-screen\nand labels drop the \"/ 2\" / \"* 10\" suffixes. The value axis becomes a\nfixed, unlabeled 0-100 track.\n\nAdd computeMeterDomain and a degenerate-domain guard to the shared\nrange-meter primitive, and cover it with a dedicated range-meter test.\n\nGive the tooltip a Target line second, with a blue color box matching\nthe main recipe's, via an invisible overlay dataset; references stay in\nafterBody below it.\n\nMove the legend to the top and drop the chart's top layout padding (the\nnormalized axis already leaves headroom), removing the now-stale title\ncomment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-06T22:20:54-04:00",
          "tree_id": "351a8cf3c5e6c920dc3a5df0d7796e4b6f13d64a",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/b15d412e09dce2384ec289fbee2040ec9e9b2c64"
