          "id": "0f9511326cb0ba7901f181899eafd0bbdfd1962a",
          "message": "Color-grade watcher target delta by proximity\n\nTint the delta arrow + magnitude with a subtle background chip graded\nby relative proximity to the target (green within 5%, through red past\n15%), the continuous extension of the existing green-check met state.\nNo tint when there's no target (or a zero target) to score against.\n\nThe tint stays on the delta alone: the main value and range-meter\nmarker still encode range position, keeping range and target signals\non separate slots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
