          "message": "Keep recipe identity when pasting into a slot\n\nPaste now replaces only the ingredient rows, keeping the slot's name,\nsaved-recipe reference, evaporation, and original baseline. The paste\nregisters as an edit of the loaded recipe (dirty when it differs from\nthe saved version) instead of dropping the recipe's identity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
