          "id": "1565a72c2f83f2493297f3f58f67736d6cbe1783",
          "message": "Re-balance on ingredient change when auto is on\n\nAdd an ingredient-identity key (row names, not quantities) to the\nauto-balance effect deps, so adding, removing, or renaming an\ningredient re-balances while auto is on. Keying on names only keeps\nthe balancer's own quantity writes from self-triggering the effect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
