          "distinct": true,
          "id": "dedc9425ea712e28a08384d88a1bcabd1e3740b7",
          "message": "Learn make-recipe container color sequence\n\nPersist the owner's container colors in the order recipes take them, so\nthe sequence they keep choosing becomes the default they stop choosing.\n\nA color is resolved into the recipe when it joins the batch, not when it\nis drawn, so the link carries the colors the owner saw. An explicit pick\nswaps within the stored sequence rather than overwriting, keeping it a\npermutation so no color becomes unreachable as a default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-21T00:17:30-04:00",
