          "distinct": true,
          "id": "45297ecb521b6ed79589ad9571341c259d2b0adf",
          "message": "Silence expected error logs in share-family tests\n\nThe recipe- and batch-share viewers log a `share:` / `make-recipe:`\nerror on their decode/calc failure branches. The negative-path suites\ndrive those branches on purpose, leaking the logs to stderr.\n\nScope a console.error spy-and-restore to the mixError degradation,\nerror states, and invalid links suites, matching the existing\nwatchers.test.tsx convention.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
