          "id": "730d95c466191eb220da841b8281869b9c29817c",
          "message": "Shrink margins around blog/doc on mobile viewports\n\n* Shrink the margings around blog posts and doc pages when on mobile\n  viewports, to allow for more content to fit in the limited width.\n* Add `.blog-post` and `.doc-page` CSS classes to control the spacing\n  of blog/doc pages in a unified location, to keep them consistent.\n* Add visual regression unit tests for the spacing of blog posts.",
