          "id": "47e7c1fd182ee37e9c6625c1442d4ae7a3ad34fe",
          "message": "Split literature and ingredient references files\n\n* Split `docs/bibliography.md` into `docs/references/literature.md` and\n  `docs/references/ingredients.md`, containing literature reference\n  footnotes (indices 1-99) and ingredient product link footnotes (100+).\n* Move `docs/bibs/N.md` to `docs/references/index/N.md`. Modify all\n  #[doc = include_str!(\"...*/docs/bibs/N.md\")] to use the new path.\n* Modify `scripts/create-individual-bibs.sh` to process both new\n  references files, and rename to `scripts/split-ref-footnotes.sh`.",
