          "id": "e778bf603ac5aca86ffea4f02ad1875a43e6f32c",
          "message": "Remove non-added stabilizer/emulsifier components\n\n* Remove non-added stabilizer and emulsifier components from\n  `composition::Stabilizers` and `composition::Emulsifiers`. For\n  components like egg and milk proteins, sugars, etc. their respective\n  specs are responsible for correctly populating `Texture`.\n* Remove references to these fields from stabilizers/emulsifiers.md",
