          "distinct": true,
          "id": "523b30b29b03a7bb1f8f1c928b8ce49ae955c72d",
          "message": "Add recipes data support, add reference recipes\n\n* Add `data` support for recipes, with new `data::recipes` module -\n  former `data` module is moved into new `data::ingredients` module.\n* Add some reference recipes in `/data/recipes/*.json`, e.g. Underbelly.",
