          "id": "295fe560c2c469dfcc20e71259b6375e1b130771",
          "message": "Add WASM and TS support for embedded recipe data\n\n* Add WASM wrappers for recipe data access functions:\n    `get_all_recipe_entry_ids_wasm`\n    `get_all_recipe_entries_wasm`\n\n* Add TypeScript support for embedded recipe data:\n    `type RecipeEntryJson`\n    `allRecipeEntries[]`\n    `recipeEntryId(RecipeEntryJson): string`\n\n* Add TODO about adding more reference recipes.",
