          "id": "d1b522d86fec85992ec5b040a99b0e773d73eb2c",
          "message": "Add search param ?slot=* to select grid recipe idx\n\n* Add support for `?slot=*` search param to select a recipe index in\n  `RecipeGrid`'s `RecipeSelect` selector. Invalid slot defaults to 0.\n* Extract `CalculatorPage` content into `CalculatorContent` so that it\n  can be wrapped inside a `Suspense` required by `useSearchParams`.",
