          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c43ff68ecbbe000e61a3dd6b9c47e36475430c97",
          "message": "Split `MixPropertiesGrid` into table/view/panel\n\nIntroduces three reusable layers in place of the single\n`MixPropertiesGrid`: `PropertiesTable` (bare table), `PropertiesView`\n(table + toolbar), and `PropertiesPanel` (grid-layout chrome + drag\nhandle + slot filter). This prepares the properties widget for reuse\nin the upcoming recipe-search page, which needs the toolbar-bearing\nview without the drag-grid panel.\n\nAdds `RecipeSummary` as the slim shape (`id`, `name`, `mixTotal`,\n`mixProperties`) sufficient for the table/view layers; `Recipe` now\nextends it with `ingredientRows`, used by the editor and `IngCompGrid`.\nAdds `filterActiveSlots` to keep slot-filter logic at the panel layer\nrather than baked into the view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-11T00:08:29-04:00",
          "tree_id": "afa339f1db3e78b8042bc60ff86c52360ba87890",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/c43ff68ecbbe000e61a3dd6b9c47e36475430c97"
