          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e6d2a23361c62295b52cfa3378d3c7397d6899ec",
          "message": "Split `RecipeGrid` into 4 layers\n\nRenames `RecipeGrid` to `RecipeEditorPanel` and splits it into a\nbare editable `RecipeEditorTable`, a stateful `RecipeEditor` view\ncarrying the toolbar (RecipeSelect, name display, copy/paste/clear\nbuttons) plus the localStorage/clipboard/context-update logic, and\na thin `RecipeEditorPanel` wrapping the grid-layout chrome and\ndrag handle. Introduces a new bare read-only `RecipeTable` for\nrecipe-search results and other display contexts.\n\nTrims `recipe.tsx` down to the data layer (types, helpers, update\nfunctions, localStorage I/O) and moves the UI tests for the editor\npanel to `recipe-editor-panel.test.tsx`, leaving `recipe.test.tsx`\nfocused on data-layer helpers. Adds tests for the new `RecipeTable`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
