          "id": "4d0fecdffa66aa8aba83783c1379e17c479f02d4",
          "message": "Rename & move `RecipeResources` -> `WasmResources`\n\n* Rename `RecipeResources` and all associated types and functions to\n  `WasmResources`, e.g. `WasmResourcesState`, `makeWasmResources`, etc.\n* Move this functionality and tests to new `lib/wasm-resources.ts` so\n  that it can be reused by multiuple pages, e.g. upcoming `/recipes`.\n* Move the `useState` and seeding of user-defined ingredients from\n  `/calculator/page.tsx` to new `useSeededWasmResources(...)` in the\n  new `wasm-resources.ts`, so that it can also be reused by other pages.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-11T15:51:07-04:00",
          "tree_id": "cb4b4ae52a1f199900f47d306141b1e2a2bb2495",
