          "message": "Introduce `wasm::Bridge::get_all_ingredient_names`\n\n* Introduce `wasm::Bridge::get_all_ingredient_names`, a WASM compatible\n  wrapper for `Bridge::get_all_ingredients` that returns just the names,\n  obviating the need for JS consumers to `.free()` the returned WASM\n  objects if they only need the name strings.",
