          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6bfbae841ac94691fd25ee55fe2bb447d43e873e",
          "message": "Add mobile layout support to `RecipeSearch`\n\n* Move the minium width constraints from recipe and properties tables to\n  their respective panels so that recipe search can set diff constraints\n* Allow `RecipeTable` and `PropertiesView` in `RecipeSearch` to shrink\n  as the container shrinks, and to organize vertically if they have\n  shrunk to the maximum they can but there is no more horizontal space.\n* On small viewports, move the search list and the detail panels to\n  organize vertically instead of side-by-side in two columns.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-12T13:49:43-04:00",
          "tree_id": "a9eaa97261f43264932a9d53bb02394d05682ad5",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/6bfbae841ac94691fd25ee55fe2bb447d43e873e"
