          "distinct": true,
          "id": "326a57f8080e2db797f41c4ebfead3e72bdb0d4a",
          "message": "Add database support for saved per-user recipes\n\n* Add a new `recipesTable` to the DB schema with per-user recipes.\n* Add new `database/assets.ts` to hold user and recipe test assets.\n* Seed the new table with `allRecipeEntries` and `TEST_USER_B_RECIPES`\n* Implement `fetchAllUserSavedRecipes` with test assets and add tests.\n* Use the new real assets and users A/B in recipe-search visual\n  regression tests, and update screenshot assets accordingly.",
