          "id": "58e8ced486978a6bbed6879b7b60737f0e9f7175",
          "message": "Add UI functionality to save and delete recipes\n\n* Add a Save button to `RecipeEditor` to save the current main recipe.\n  This is disabled if user is not logged in, if it's a reference, etc.\n* Add Delete button to `RecipeSearch` to delete a saved recipe. This is\n  disabled if built-in, user not logged in, no recipe selected, etc.",
