          "message": "Allow higher threshold for empty chart visual diff\n\nSometimes, particularly when running locally, the tests for empty charts\nfail with more than 112/199 different pixels. These are for stable empty\ncharts, and I'm tired of dealing with these spurious failures, so I'm\nallowing a higher threshold of different pixels for now.",
