          "id": "0d96290f04b4a590daa33e0211252761ba7eef3c",
          "message": "Add full-content visual regression snapshots\n\n`fullPage: true` only captures the viewport when content lives in the\nnavbar's inner `overflow-auto` scroller. Add a `data-testid` hook on\nthat scroller and a `setViewportHeightForAllContentScreenshot` helper\nthat grows the viewport by the scroller's vertical overflow, then\ntake a paired `-all-content` snapshot for each layout test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
