          "distinct": true,
          "id": "53675e057320f2264b51109f4dd917072ddbcd64",
          "message": "Stitch all-content shots for recipes/ingredients\n\nThe previous resize-based all-content screenshots distorted the search\npages, since `EntitySearch` panels adapt to viewport height. Capture\nthem by scrolling `[data-testid='app-content']` in viewport-sized\nsteps and stitching the frames with `sharp`, keeping the layout at\nits natural size.\n\nSkip the all-content screenshot entirely when the scroller has no\noverflow (e.g. mobile-landscape recipes/ingredients, where the\n`md:h-[75vh]` layout fits the viewport with internal-only scrolling).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-15T23:32:42-04:00",
          "tree_id": "289943177abf6ded2926b9b50072f525bc914486",
