          "distinct": true,
          "id": "39384356b49b547879ff2f29235a52c624a8a1df",
          "message": "Split `WatcherCard` tests into own spec file\n\n`components.spec.ts` mixed panel-level visual checks with component-level\n`WatcherCard` close-ups. Extract the four card tests (and their range/\nno-range invariant guard) into `watcher-card.spec.ts`, and rename the\nremaining file `panels.spec.ts` to reflect what it now covers. Move\n`presetWatcherSelection` into `util.ts` since both files use it.\n\nSnapshot directories renamed via `git mv` to preserve history.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-16T14:26:25-04:00",
          "tree_id": "d42de42ade84613b165fb5ac9ccf812666f7d923",
