          "id": "cdb2452339c9c133b8384d673fc512530acff490",
          "message": "Add stable scrollbar gutter to `app-content`\n\nPrevents scrollbar toggle from flipping the calculator's\n`react-grid-layout` breakpoint at viewport widths that put the\ncontainer near a boundary (e.g. Pixel 5 landscape at 802px).\n\nSurfaced as intermittent `calculator-mobile-small-landscape`\nvisual regression failures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
