          "id": "e0591360f5769e34e0378c98ff6f569cc0a2e627",
          "message": "Add `DairyLabelSpec::sucrose` and sweet condensed\n\n* Add new `DairyLabelSpec::sucrose` field to support added sugars, e.g.\n  in sweetened condensed milk ingredients; lactose = total - sucrose.\n* Add new sweetened condensed milk ingredients from USDA and brands.\n* Add TODO about adding milk/cream from USDA; investigate proteins.",
