          "distinct": true,
          "id": "77264f1831a4e02d58646e043fcc05f12dc1aa60",
          "message": "Snapshot embedded spec and recipe entry lists\n\nReplace the hand-maintained embedded-data count constants with\nname-list snapshots, so a data change shows exactly which entries\nwere added, removed, or changed type instead of just a count delta.\n\n- Snapshot the sorted spec entry names (Rust `insta`, TS Vitest),\n  with total/non-alias/independent counts in the header; alias and\n  composite entries carry a type prefix, plain ingredients do not.\n- Snapshot the sorted recipe entry IDs the same way.\n- Drop the now-redundant exact-count assertions from the remaining\n  spec/recipe tests; keep their structural checks.\n- Add `snapshots:*` package.json scripts and rename the existing\n  cargo-insta scripts to `snapshots:rust:*`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-21T13:44:25-04:00",
          "tree_id": "23e5bfbca7a8935a6074466a0363129464c4400b",
