          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c805b2113b7797c1dbd91970ea142434d02b0690",
          "message": "Add USDA dairy ingredients, estimate trans fat\n\nAdd five USDA Survey (FNDDS) entries to dairy.json: skim and 2%\nreduced-fat milk, and light, half-and-half, and heavy cream.\n\nEstimate trans fat for all USDA dairy entries as 3.5% of total\nfat (STD_TRANS_FAT_IN_MILK_FAT), since USDA does not report it.\n\nResolve cross-source comparison tests through the embedded\ningredient database instead of in-file spec fixtures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-21T17:07:11-04:00",
          "tree_id": "57b3c5eac063ac2c1fe6849c1ed77281dedd44a3",
