          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b629a35ce9d2a8b43f8f7508abe1d04eb4038071",
          "message": "Add SaturatedFat and TransFat composition keys\n\nExpose total saturated and trans fat across all fat sources via two\nnew CompKey variants, with display strings and tests. Update each\nspec's to_composition test to assert the new keys, and add them to\nCOMPARABLE_DAIRY_KEYS with per-test ceiling overrides where the\nexisting data sources diverge (small servings round trans fat\naggressively; some labels report trans as exactly 0 while others\nreport a small non-zero value).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-23T15:20:08-04:00",
          "tree_id": "90f259cc9b60045b12a091302f226e083713b353",
