          "distinct": true,
          "id": "61ea1d6a90eff60b4f19fc6d69113d6afe3d145b",
          "message": "Set placeholder POSTGRES_URL in bundle bench CI\n\n`next build` evaluates server modules during page-data collection;\n`/api/auth/signup` transitively loads `lib/database/util.ts`, which\ncalls `.replace()` on `POSTGRES_URL` and crashes with an undefined env.\nThe bundle_benchmarks job never connects to a DB, so a syntactically\nvalid placeholder is enough to get past module load.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-26T14:12:03-04:00",
          "tree_id": "4966caa6d388a3552f4f514d4e1504294cf67a1e",
