          "message": "Remove use cases of sugars = avg(carbo..., sugars)\n\n* Remove cases where the sugar content on a `DairyLabelSpec` was\n  inferred to be an average of the total carbohydrates and the sugars on\n  the label. This is in preparation for upcoming `carbohydrates` field.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-26T23:51:55-04:00",
