          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e2055da66a5ce55dac9284c6dc7111a3ec11cf8e",
          "message": "Add `balance` method to `Recipe` and `Bridge`\n\n`Recipe::balance` adjusts ingredient amounts via NNLS to match\nthe given target composition values, preserving total grams,\nname, and ingredient order. Exposed across the API surface:\n\n- Native: `Recipe::balance`, `Bridge::balance_recipe`\n- WASM: `Bridge::balance_recipe`, `Recipe::balance`\n- TS: `bridge.balance_recipe(recipe, targets)` returns a\n  balanced light recipe\n\nAdds `From<Recipe> for OwnedLightRecipe` for the bridge return\nshape, and `balancing_targets_from_jsvalue` helper for parsing\n`(CompKey, f64)[]` from JS.\n\nIncludes unit tests at each layer, and follow-up TODOs for\ndocs, TS-side `wasm::Recipe` tests, adopting `serde_repr` on\n`CompKey`/`FpdKey`, and a string-based serialization path for\npermanent storage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-28T17:06:58-04:00",
          "tree_id": "79647fd32d146f8d88e7402058f6c384b8b3a86a",
