          "message": "Add TODO about '-D warnings' in `*local-test-*.sh`\n\n* Add TODO about adding '-D warnings' to RUSTFLAGS AND RUSTDOCFLAGS in\n  `scripts/run-local-test-suite.sh` to prevent warnings from slipping\n  and breaking CI. Unfortunately, this causes a lot of recompilation,\n  since VSC settings and package.json don't have those flags set.\n* Add `--document-private-items` to `doc` script in `package.json`.",
