          "distinct": true,
          "id": "970f35bb2e9e196c7f60292a34f259e72bbec0bf",
          "message": "Make `KeyCeiling` generic over its key type\n\n* Make `KeyCeiling` generic over its key type, instead of hard-coding\n  `CompKey`, in order to support `BalanceKey` as well and remove the\n  current `for_balance_key` workaround that excluded `RatioKey`s in\n  `BalanceKey::Ratio` variants. Callers now use the single `for_key`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-07T01:24:44-04:00",
          "tree_id": "3bf0eee5d9424dd372238035472ac29084315db7",
