          "id": "835f56b92e9fda73054d4bb7b6c4731d6e694085",
          "message": "Add TS-side benches for `Recipe/Bridge.balance_*`\n\n* Add TS-side benchmarks for `Recipe.balance` and\n  `Bridge.balance_recipe`, balancing a reference recipe to its own\n  composition as targets, for all balanceable keys (comp and ratio).\n* Add `balancing.ts:getBalanceableKeys()`: all `PropKey` - `FpdKey`s.\n* Add TODO about only tracking some TS-side benches on every CI run.",
