          "id": "3067f7651d86a29546f1f8f46b03fdeff87aedde",
          "message": "Slightly modify simple milk powder ingredients\n\n* Slightly modify the `DairySimpleSpec` 'Skimmed Milk Powder' and\n  'Whole Milk Powder' ingredients to more closely match Goff & Hartel\n  and reference bulk products. This change cascades into many minor\n  adjustments to expected values in tests throughout the crate.\n* Fix Goff & Hartel citations, 8th ed. 2025 is [^20], not [^2].",
