          "message": "Fix `sci-cream/CHANGELOG.md` to remove rel 0.0.5\n\n* An attempt to `cargo release patch --execute` failed due to expired\n  credentials, and that inadvertently created a new release semver when\n  re-attempting. Fix by removing 0.0.5, since it was published as 0.0.6",
