          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6201f3d015c881fed8b5b98096448adeafb90085",
          "message": "Add balancing tests for NetPAC and AbsNetPAC\n\nExtend the BalanceKey unit tests (is_ratio, ratio_parts,\nget_balanceable_keys, ratio-denominator inference) to cover the new\nNetPAC / AbsNetPAC keys, and add recovery tests on a cocoa-bearing\npalette where the hardness factor makes NetPAC distinct from TotalPAC.\n\nAlso pin current behavior: a negative NetPAC target (HF > TotalPAC) is\nstill rejected as a NegativeTarget, even though NetPAC can legitimately\ngo below zero.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-10T21:52:27-04:00",
          "tree_id": "c59e5fecaedeb20a1768168a5f072060e3fab4c3",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/6201f3d015c881fed8b5b98096448adeafb90085"
