          "message": "Replace calc-height view layouts with flex columns\n\nThe properties, composition, and properties-chart views plus the FPD\ngraph panel sized their scroll/content area with h-[calc(100%-33px)],\nhardcoding the toolbar's height. Switch each to a flex column (toolbar at\nnatural height, content flex-1 min-h-0) so the content fills the\nremaining space without the magic number and adapts if the toolbar's\nheight changes. Behavior is unchanged for a single-row toolbar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-11T15:04:47-04:00",
          "tree_id": "808468834bcad48259798e07abaee546f8ba196f",
