          "id": "2526ef3f733878a3f2afdb4657882ed4b69b3b86",
          "message": "Add full-content screenshot test for the key-filter popup\n\nAdd an expandToFullHeight visual helper that drops a fixed-height\nelement's height constraints so a single screenshot captures all its\ncontent, without the sticky-element duplication that captureFullContent\nproduces. Use it for a new KeyFilterSelect Custom-popup test that\ncaptures the entire checklist, with its generated baseline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
