          "message": "Adjust `.toolbar` gap and truncate in `RecipeTable`\n\n* Adjust the `.toolbar` class to reduce the gap between select items.\n* Use `truncate` in `RecipeTable` so long names don't break layouts.\n* Add TODOs about tables that may look too wider or too narrow in some\n  layouts, and about `/recipe` doing unnecessary ingredient fetches.",
