          "distinct": true,
          "id": "0f03cb04082a9ae998f44cd5bb5256f256509849",
          "message": "Split structural & display composition hierarchies\n\nReorganize CompKey ordering and grouping, adding the previously\nmissing MilkSugars and EggProteins keys to the enum, get() match,\ndisplay strings, and structural forest.\n\nExpose structural_hierarchy alongside display_hierarchy (renamed\nfrom comp_hierarchy), each with its own WASM and TS accessor. Only\nthe display forest keeps the _ordered and _roots helpers.\n\nFix the hierarchy tests for the new source-first forest order and\nthe exact MSNF = MilkSugars + MilkSNFS split, checking the strict\nsubset relations on ordinary milk where lactose is non-zero.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-12T19:34:16-04:00",
          "tree_id": "200620406bbaeb669f57b56b320898ef08d54fc6",
