          "id": "fa50e41fea1d0a063fd877ff1e5bc49f580dc1fa",
          "message": "Skip LFS smudge in CI except visual tests\n\ngithub-action-benchmark's internal `git checkout -` smudges LFS\nfiles that no job needs. Set GIT_LFS_SKIP_SMUDGE=1 workflow-wide and\noverride to 0 for the only job that needs them (visual snapshots).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
