          "message": "Skip warning checks in balance_compositions path\n\nbalance_compositions only consumes error-severity issues (via\ninto_result), yet it ran the full validate_balancing_targets,\ncomputing and discarding the costlier warning checks that scan\nevery composition (per-target reachability, pairwise and additive\ndominance).\n\nSplit validation into append_input_error_issues (cheap, no\ncomposition data) and append_input_warning_issues. The solve path\nnow runs only the error checks; validate_balancing_targets composes\nboth, so the inspection report is unchanged in content.\n\nThis groups the report errors-first, moving the duplicate-priority\nerror ahead of the warnings; re-accept the input_errors snapshot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-14T04:30:23-04:00",
          "tree_id": "6e934bc39c3bdebe6ede3d8bf3f44327616fbd5d",
