          "id": "7a87a711a29072dfaa7c100c43d14005fac6fb33",
          "message": "Skip Vercel analytics scripts outside Vercel deploys\n\nGate <Analytics> and <SpeedInsights> on process.env.VERCEL so the\nscripts are not requested in local dev, eliminating the 404s for\n/_vercel/insights/script.js and /_vercel/speed-insights/script.js\nthat appear in every e2e run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
