          "id": "32db1bda3c1d9ada0fdd5b9aa4a0f296ce2690ef",
          "message": "Fix ESLint crash with eslint-plugin-react on ESLint 10\n\neslint-plugin-react calls context.getFilename() when version is\n\"detect\", but that API was removed in ESLint 9. Hardcode version\nto avoid the broken detection path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
