          "distinct": true,
          "id": "0a93f776d992598bb1834f2b75d1c5b91e871283",
          "message": "Defer calculator grid render until measured\n\nuseContainerWidth defaulted to measureBeforeMount: false, so mounted\nwas true on first render and the {mounted && ...} gate was a no-op. The\ngrid mounted at the placeholder width with default layouts, then raced\nthe real width change against stored-layout adoption. On a full refresh\nthe container is already laid out so both batch together, but a\nclient-side navigation could settle back to the default layout.\n\nPass measureBeforeMount: true so the gate defers the grid's first\nrender until width measurement and layout hydration have batched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-15T22:08:26-04:00",
          "tree_id": "9498027b35b116c041225e6ae95dfabd054f86eb",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/0a93f776d992598bb1834f2b75d1c5b91e871283"
