          "id": "6665a79143341718003e5ad7013a37d553a631d4",
          "message": "Move select-persistence tests to view test files\n\nPanel tests are the wrong home for toolbar localStorage\nround-trips — the view layer owns that state. Move the\nSelect persistence describe blocks out of the four panel\ntest files and into the corresponding _elements/ view\ntest files, rendering the view directly with a persistKey.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
