          "id": "be2552b61c17f663da18960c39f05de8b195b468",
          "message": "Add benches `compute_fpd_curves`, various methods\n\n* Add new benchmarks for `fpd::compute_fpd_curves`, evaluating the\n  performance using various methods for PAC -> FPD lookups and for\n  calculating the curves, e.g. Goff & Hartel, mod. G & H & Corvitto.",
