          "distinct": true,
          "id": "43d55c88c340646512f872a8fd154bf4b88d557e",
          "message": "Introduce `interpolate_pairs`, `fast_*` utilities\n\n* Introduce `interpolate_pairs` and `fast_interpolate_pairs` utilities\n  to interpolate values from lookup tables, e.g. PAC -> FPD tables,\n  density tables, etc. Add new benchmarks for these two functions.\n* Change the PAC_TO_FPD_TABLE types from (usize, f64) to (u32, f64).",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-18T18:30:16-04:00",
