          "distinct": true,
          "id": "bb155cbccc67e469b160069bbcd6eb3be8f9d01a",
          "message": "Move balancing `MAX_NUM_GROUP_*` to consts module\n\n* Move the balancing limit constans `MAX_NUM_GROUP_SIZE_FOR_TYPICAL`,\n  new `*_SIZE_FOR_HIGHER_ORDER`, and `HIGHER_ORDER_CANDIDATE_LIMIT` to\n  the `constants::balancing` module.\n* Increate the group size thresholds to 6 for the <= 20 case, and to 3\n  for the higher order cases. Worst case scenario runs in ~85 ms.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-18T18:45:12-04:00",
          "tree_id": "45ec2b9e02da91d6da6be5236096ccdb350783b8",
