          "distinct": true,
          "id": "69ad98274a9b14d5b3e6cb012c416e4fd67719d9",
          "message": "Add ABV/ABW conversions from ethanol density\n\nAdd abw_to_abv, abv_to_abw, and abv_from_abw_and_density, which\nderive the conversion from the concentration-dependent\nETHANOL_SOLUTIONS_DENSITY table rather than a flat ratio.\n\nCover them with tests: known values, node round-trip inversion,\ninterpolation preconditions, and a cross-check against a published\nvolume-percent table (Mini Industry, ref 54). That last check is\nnot independent of the density data, so add a TODO to validate the\ndensity table itself against a second source.\n\nAdd supporting references 52-54 (FDA CFR, Perry & Green, Mini\nIndustry).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-19T00:50:26-04:00",
          "tree_id": "6b3a44d4de74097e9d092d2851476007e3e7d727",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/69ad98274a9b14d5b3e6cb012c416e4fd67719d9"
