          "id": "314d69265dc914b63054a5a51db0949af541d1cb",
          "message": "Remove `env CI=true` frm `run-local-test-suite.sh`\n\n* Now that timing-sensitive end-to-end tests are more stable, remove\n  `env CI=true` from `pnpm test` in `scripts/run-local-test-suite.sh`,\n  so that tests can run in parallel; CI=true forces serial execution.",
