          "distinct": true,
          "id": "5cc0e72e8c60342a15f61bbeee2c81534f4f2eb0",
          "message": "Redesign WatcherCard with range-meter gauge\n\nMake a horizontal range-meter the signature element: the acceptable\nband becomes a visual track with a status-colored current marker plus\ntarget and reference ticks. Quiet the tinted header to a slim status\nrail, fit the target input beside the main value on one row, and show\nreferences side by side.\n\nLay the grid out flat and gapless via collapsed 1px gridlines. Add\nshared .data-card-flat, .range-meter*, and .btn-primary classes to\nglobals.css and restyle the panel toolbar. Update the delta-slot unit\ntests to match the always-rendered fixed-width target delta.\n\n* Include all refs - WatchersPanel now passes down unfiltered - so that\n  A/B always have a consistent position, but set hidden if it's empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
