          "id": "250ad205f845279bcc2c607f64550cbcf675e458",
          "message": "Reduce the standard step for balanced recipe input\n\n* Reduce the standard step percentage used in `makeBalanceRecipeUpdates`\n  in order to allow the balanced properties to lose less precision and\n  more closely match their targets, at the cost of some UI clutter.",
