          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4a6e7134edfe3ec914b3962635bb8ac4352a37e8",
          "message": "Move PropKey helpers into the sci-cream package\n\nRelocate domain-level PropKey helpers out of the app and into the\ncrate's TS layer, where they sit alongside the key primitives they\nbuild on:\n\n- isPropKeyQuantity, isPropKeyMixScope, getMixScopePropKeys -> prop-key.ts\n- getAcceptablePropertyRange -> new ranges.ts (separate feature)\n\nTests move with each function. App consumers now import these from\n@workspace/sci-cream, and the duplicate local getMixScopePropKeys in\nproperties.tsx is dropped in favor of the shared one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
