          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e4b1ab481beb4957a66846b11eacc1e71b16942e",
          "message": "Restyle FpdGraph to match PropChart/Watchers\n\nBring FpdGraph in line with the redesigned bar chart and watcher\ncards: drop the in-chart title, mute axes to TextSecondary with no\nspines, style the tooltip as a bordered surface card, and use the\nsurface color for the ideal-serving marker so it reads in dark mode.\n\nHoist the shared chart-chrome constants (CHART_TOP_PADDING, TOOLTIP_*,\nTOOLTIP_BODY_FONT) into sizes.ts so both charts share one source of\ntruth; remove the now-unused GRAPH_TITLE_FONT_SIZE.\n\nReference lines are muted gray (no dashing). The tooltip names the\nrecipe and curve on separate lines, and pointHitRadius enlarges each\npoint's hover target so non-highlighted points are easy to hover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-26T01:14:04-04:00",
          "tree_id": "8fd0106084689ab387b4ff1b084761118b28594c",
