          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4c46cf8426a01ba71c491e602906a6265541fdbd",
          "message": "Remove explicit webkit test skips in visual tests\n\n* Remove explicit `test.skip(browserName === \"webkit\", ...)` in visual\n  regression e2e tests, since they are only run on chromium. If this\n  ever changes, fill should be used instead of paste, not skip tests.\n* Add a browser check and a throw if \"webkit\" in `pasteToClipboard`.",
