          "distinct": true,
          "id": "88a810b9b83e05fd88104b74861689ea192a010f",
          "message": "Use `compositionFormatStep` for watcher input step\n\n* Add `compositionFormatStep` that returns a step for a composition\n  value magnitude so that the step matches the displayed precision.\n* Use this new step in Watcher's input so that using the step arrows\n  can always land on an exact match with the main recipe's value.\n* Fix the direction of the delta calculations. It should be `main -\n  target`, so the delta is the main value relative to the target.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-28T02:07:00-04:00",
          "tree_id": "24c7daf94e63c2495987b951031d7a2146a2dee3",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/88a810b9b83e05fd88104b74861689ea192a010f"
