          "distinct": true,
          "id": "00bccae422fea1e858394203ace9ddf0a0043927",
          "message": "Self-host Geist fonts for deterministic ∆ glyph\n\nThe delta glyph rendered via a system fallback font: Geist's Google\nFonts latin subset has no Greek block, so Δ (U+0394) fell back to\nwhatever sans the environment had. That made visual snapshots\nnon-deterministic across local, CI, and act.\n\nSwitch from next/font/google to the self-hosted `geist` package (the\nfull, un-subsetted font) and use ∆ (U+2206 INCREMENT) instead of Δ: the\nbundled font contains U+2206 but not U+0394, so it renders from Geist\nitself everywhere, with no fallback.\n\nExtract a shared DELTA_GLYPH constant used by the toggle labels and the\nproperties table header, guarded by a test asserting it stays U+2206.\nAdd a TODO to subset the self-hosted font later to reclaim payload.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-29T16:36:36-04:00",
          "tree_id": "7e3d78fa068d1a842e261d83dd8e5236979cfcd4",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/00bccae422fea1e858394203ace9ddf0a0043927"
