          "distinct": true,
          "id": "457c1ba0d13e794604b045e6d2f84a99eda9e6b3",
          "message": "Restyle table header and totals rows\n\nGive the calculator tables a typographic refresh over the existing 1px\ncell grid:\n\n- Header (.table-col-header): drop the grid borders and inset top rule\n  for a borderless uppercase tracked label with a single bottom rule.\n- Totals rows: new .table-total class — a bold summary band set on a\n  recessed page-colored fill, still sharing the data cells' grid\n  borders. Applied to the recipe editor, read-only recipe, and\n  composition-breakdown totals rows (was .table-emphasis).\n\nThe data cells and the properties row-label / rollup column keep the\n1px grid. The properties table has no aggregate total, so it is left\nas a flat list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-02T14:33:55-04:00",
