          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6970e040f77cde1442b2b70882b73d145d6a8000",
          "message": "Fix recipe search flicker via useResetOnChange\n\nThe recipe detail panel was remounted on every entry switch (via a\nReact `key`) solely to reset the selected-version state. Remounting\nalso re-initialized PropertiesView's persisted toolbar selects, which\nstart at their defaults and only restore stored values in a mount\neffect — flashing default toggle labels and property rows for a frame.\n\nKeep the panel mounted and reset the selected version during render\ninstead. Extract that render-phase \"reset state when a key changes\"\nlogic into a reusable `useResetOnChange` hook so the reset value is\nreturned in the same render with no intermediate frame on stale state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-02T15:43:27-04:00",
          "tree_id": "20521d03bbcf5866724f5fd9e5b4121c7a4a7bf0",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/6970e040f77cde1442b2b70882b73d145d6a8000"
