          "id": "a52df9ee0e124d8d7fd2b0ec66f62fbbd2baed5d",
          "message": "Scope e2e Clear locator to recipe button\n\nThe new Watchers \"Clear all target values\" button made the loose\n\"Clear\" accessible-name match ambiguous, tripping Playwright strict\nmode. Match \"Clear recipe\" exactly so the helper targets only the\nrecipe-editor Clear button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
