          "id": "15f2f8f2279932fc439edb13a5fedfcedf8aeed2",
          "message": "Reorder app TODO items into prioritized phases\n\nOrder the Next Release section by implementation phase: bug fixes,\nthe watchers/targets color cluster, small features, visual tests,\nthen the make-recipe page. Defer the recipe-share implementation to\nUp Next, leaving a design-doc item in its place, and pull up three\ncompanion items (delete-version button jitter, balancing e2e tests,\nsave-recipe visual tests).\n\nAlso merge the two duplicate recipe-diff items and update stale\ncomponent names (MixPropertiesGrid, MixPropertiesChart,\nIngredientCompositionGrid) to their current equivalents.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
