          "message": "Add `is_alias_for` tests, rename \"light\" -> \"18\"\n\n* Introduce `is_alias_for` and add tests in `compare_specs` that check\n  aliases relevant to test names, e.g. \"Half and Half\" -> \"10% Cream\".\n* Rename `*_light_cream` to `*_18_cream`, due to ambiguous light/table.",
