          "distinct": true,
          "id": "fcc2d9755e07ab6f8397924cd71859524897044a",
          "message": "Add Ice Cream Science's 'Chocolate Ice Cream'\n\n* Add two reference recipes for Ice Cream Science's 'Chocolate Ice\n  Cream' recipe: the as-is pre-evaporation recipe, used if following the\n  recipe's cooking instructions that call for 15% evaporation, and a\n  post-evaporation recipe that has an accurate mix composition, and\n  which should be used with low evaporation methods, such as sous vide.\n* Rename some ingredients to prefix \"USDA\" and add aliases to the old\n  name. Also add instant coffee ingredients, and some vanilla aliases.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-07T21:23:53-04:00",
          "tree_id": "b08e62db677efa6a17e1f33177393c58ef11b937",
