          "message": "Add `DairySimpleSpec::sucrose` field support\n\n* Add new `DairySimpleSpec::sucrose` field to accomodate dairy products\n  with added sugar, notably sweetened condensed milk from Goff & Hartel.\n* Add new 'sweetened condensed milk' ingredients from Goff & Hartel, and\n  add them to the existing `compare_specs_*` with other ingredients.",
