          "distinct": true,
          "id": "155933c8be13e33de70ff9bcca8fdf7936905d0a",
          "message": "Add visual test for evaporation yield display\n\nCover the read-only RecipeTable's post-evaporation yield span and the\ndetail panel's Evap (g) readout by selecting the built-in \"Ice Cream\nScience: Chocolate Ice Cream\" recipe (evaporation 150g).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
