          "distinct": true,
          "id": "cefb167fa18eba9def21bfe929a576aeacedfbff",
          "message": "Flatten RecipeEditor toolbar to match other views\n\nMove the `toolbar` class onto the outer flex row so the recipe\nselect, evaporation input, and action buttons share one toolbar\ncontainer, matching the PropertiesView/CompositionView pattern.\nAdd a visual regression test for the recipe-editor toolbar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
