          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e2425b29a16d0a1e78297eaa9f6e520a696aefe2",
          "message": "Tighten mass-fraction target domains to [0, 100]\n\nClassify the balancing target domain on CompKey, delegated from\nBalanceKey::target_domain: Energy, POD, and the PAC family (incl. HF)\nstay [0, inf), while every mass-fraction key and ABV now admits\n[0, 100]. Impossible targets like MSNF = 150 error as OutOfDomainTarget\ninstead of only warning unreachable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:44:04-04:00",
          "tree_id": "404df92b6743d495eea3aeb6da7d3fe811d95751",
