          "distinct": true,
          "id": "48601cd2df8a50e909028040fe2142e078a352a7",
          "message": "Fix target-proximity coloring for negative targets\n\ngetTargetColor divided by target instead of abs(target), flipping the\nsign of delta for negative targets (e.g. FPD, ServingTemp) and always\nscoring them Green regardless of actual proximity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
