          "id": "ab52b3398e3f14b9be9ec400499328d3ae345e63",
          "message": "Use official rustlang/cargo Cargo.toml JSON schema\n\nUse the official rust-lang/cargo Cargo.toml JSON schema with the VS Code\nEven Better TOML extension (tamasfe.even-better-toml) for validation of\nCargo.toml files. This solves validation issues with [lints.rust/clippy]",
