          "distinct": true,
          "id": "7539442991c45e6abf699a9a0d46a046726e18dd",
          "message": "Add functionality for markdown blug/docs content\n\n* Add `markdown.ts` with functionality to read markdown files with\n  frontmatter and convert them to HTML. This is accomplished using\n  new dependencies: `gray-matter`, `remark`, and `remark-html`.\n* Add new routes `/blog` and `/docs`, along with corresponding navbar\n  items, which render a list of all markdown files in the new `content`\n  directory, at subdirectories `/blog` and `/docs`. Each item has a link\n  to a page with the HTML produced from the markdown files.\n* Use `@tailwindcss/typography` to display the pages from markdown.\n* Add WIP `recipes.md` and `resources.md` with links to other external\n  resources, e.g. Underbelly, Ice Cream Science, icecreamcalc.com, etc.\n* Add some simple example content in `content/blog` and `/docs`.\n* Add `content/TODO.md` to track TODOs specifically for static content.\n  Currently it includes several TODOs regarding some stabilizer\n  experiments, experience with herb ice creams, lecithin, etc.\n* Add `docs/getting-started.md` and `blog/2025-04-27-welcome.md` drafts\n  with an introduction and a general overview of the app and website.\n* Update visual regression tests to accomodate new navbar items.\n* Add CSS class modifiers to remove the visible backticks that\n  @twilwindcss/typography adds; this conflicts with markdown-sourced\n  content, where backticks indicate code but should not be rendered.",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-28T12:45:29-04:00",
          "tree_id": "ecc981178d48f67ad8e5c366e0b90c43229c2afd",
