          "message": "Draft blog welcome post, add images LFS, TODOs\n\n* Expand the draft of the `blog/2026-04-27-welcome.md` post, to near\n  completion, waiting only for the latest release before publishing.\n* Add `packages/app/public/images` to git LFS, for blog/docs images.\n* Fix some typos in `packages/app/TODO.md`\n* Add a few more items to `docs/resources.md`\n* Add images for the 2026-04-27 blog post to `public/images/blog`\n* Add items to `content/TODO.md` to update welcome post images and\n  content to reflect latest release, and include Patreon links.",
