          "distinct": true,
          "id": "db1693c42f5163833ec09fced28e19a38aa486fc",
          "message": "Add `Recipe.id/name` and rework update/store intf\n\n* Rename current `Recipe.name` field to `id`, to hold \"Recipe\", \"Ref A\",\n  \"Ref B. Add a new `name` field that holds an optionally empty recipe\n  name, e.g. \"Underbelly: Standard Base\", use for display purposes.\n* Display the recipe name on `RecipeGrid` and `FpdGraph` components.\n* Rework the interface for updating recipe state and storing/retrieving\n  stored recipes from local storage. Update methods now support the\n  `name` field, via new `RecipeUpdates` interface. Functions to set and\n   retrieve recipes from local storage now also support a `name`, via\n  the new `RecipeStore` interface, and they are exported so that they\n  can be used by other component, e.g. upcoming `RecipeSearch`.\n* Introduce and export `makeRecipeId` for index -> \"Recipe\", \"Ref N\"",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-09T23:18:54-04:00",
          "tree_id": "0f63b93a4ec61b7dccd1b488245c89c2f054a2ce",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/db1693c42f5163833ec09fced28e19a38aa486fc"
