          "id": "299ec0fd847efa3e6058ab4e07867428fa197182",
          "message": "Consolidate per-component files; move recipe data\n\nMerges each component's bare and view layers into a single file\nnamed after the component, dropping the explicit `-table`/`-view`\nsuffix now that one file holds both layers. Tests follow suit.\n\nMoves `_components/recipe.tsx` (types, factories, persistence\nhelpers — no JSX) to `lib/recipe.ts` where it sits alongside the\nother domain/utility modules. Drops the unused `\"use client\"`\ndirective and updates all import paths to `@/lib/recipe`.\n\nCuts the new code from 28 to 22 files. Each consolidated file\nruns ~200–400 lines and stays reviewable; splitting back out\nlater if any one grows is a 5-minute change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
