          "id": "ab2fc02751a4a868ab805ba05e7e2b05473edc71",
          "message": "Update CLAUDE.md for refactored app structure\n\nDocuments the bare/view/panel layering, the new `*Panel` names\nconsumed by the calculator page, the split between `_components/`\n(panels) and `_elements/{tables,charts}/` (reusable widgets), and\nthe `lib/recipe.ts` data layer. Drops a stale line about\n`RecipeContext` caching ingredient transfer objects by name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
