          "distinct": true,
          "id": "3c9c57c0a0a3c583e9af0048d50d767c66676d08",
          "message": "Fix 'null pointer passed to rust' error when paste\n\n* There was an issue when pasting a recipe with an invalid ingredient,\n  editing it to be valid, then pasting a new recipe, the app would\n  crash. This was narrowed down to a more fundamental issue, when\n  pasting a new valid ingredient on top of a previous valid one the app\n  would crash. It's unclear why this didn't happen when pasting full\n  valid recipes on top of previous full valid recipes.\n* Add unit and e2e tests to replicate this, which fail before a fix.\n* The issue was identified to a bug in `requiresMixPropsUpdate` trying\n  to access a freed WASM object. The tests pass after a fix is applied.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-14T12:13:25-04:00",
