          "id": "b121300b6bee2325a154db7048aa5ee4663d7984",
          "message": "Change `WatchersView` default Auto, add more keys\n\n* Change the default `KeyFilter` in `WatchersView` to `KeyFilter.Auto`,\n  and set a larger number of default selected keys, including some\n  without acceptable ranges; this mirrors `PropertiesChartView`.\n* Remove the watchers-panel mixed-keys test case; they're all that now.\n* Move `presetWatcherSelection` from util.ts to watcher-card.spec.ts.\n* Update visual regression test assets to accomodate these changes.",
