          "message": "Add `lactose_free` support to `DairySimpleSpec`\n\n* Add `lactose_free` field to `DairySimpleSpec`, to support simple\n  lactose-free milk and cream products; lactose -> glucose/galactose.\n* Add \"Lactose-Free\" ingredient to `data/ingredients/dairy.json`.\n* Rename `DairyLabelSpec::is_lactose_free` to `::lactose_free`.\n* Add TODO about adding support for composites with inline specs.",
