          "id": "dfd6421dc5a3dad38ce9dedd810a505a7a35271f",
          "message": "Support inline specs as `CompositeSpec` components\n\nA composite component can now be an inline `TaggedSpec` in addition to\na named reference. Inline specs are resolved directly via\n`to_composition`, with no `IngredientGetter` lookup, so a composite can\nbe fully self-describing. Nested inline composites are rejected since\n`to_composition` errors for `CompositeSpec`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-20T10:47:35-04:00",
          "tree_id": "71ad0efe97a909283c7855f2241ff653c406f403",
