          "id": "32d4fc5f8ebba640c3da2427b22f2271923bff1c",
          "message": "Add cross-source comparison tests for milk/cream\n\nCovers all five ingredient triplets that have Simple, USDA, and\nSealtest entries: skim, 2%, half-and-half, light, and whipping\ncream. Each test documents known per-key ceilings with comments\nexplaining the root causes (near-zero fat rounding, coarse\nSealtest serving sizes, USDA fat measurement vs. nominal %).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
