          "id": "9a90ce160f19b7c13bccf25b1535f10a25073b1a",
          "message": "Add dairy aliases, document default ingredients\n\nAdd friendly-name aliases for the two cream rungs that\nlacked them: Half and Half -> 10% Cream and Table Cream\n-> 18% Cream, plus lactose-free parity for each.\n\nDocument in CLAUDE.md that the brand-neutral DairySimpleSpec\nmilk/cream entries are the canonical defaults, while the\nnamed-source DairyLabelSpec entries (USDA, Sealtest, ...)\nare real-world reference data for the cross-source tests.\n\nRegenerate the embedded-spec-entry snapshots (Rust + TS)\nto include the four new aliases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
