          "id": "e32c24cb9803c7ab5b55732c1196619a01665a56",
          "message": "Consolidate benchmark utilities into shared module\n\nExtract BenchmarkResult, BenchmarkResultForUpload, analyzeMeasurements,\nthe formatters, and writeBenchmarkResultsToFile from e2e/util.ts into a\nnew __benches__/util.ts so the bundle and e2e benches share one writer\nand one formatter family.\n\nRename formatMemoryBenchmarkResultForUpload to\nformatByteSizeBenchmarkResultForUpload with a \"KB\" | \"MB\" unit param,\nsince the same helper now serves bundle and memory metrics. Push the\nbytes→unit conversion out of `getUsedJSHeapSizeInMB`, which becomes\n`getUsedJSHeapSize` (returns bytes) — the formatter does the division.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
