          "id": "2bda545b1c8a544e2987a0fe62697895d6e1612b",
          "message": "Compare dairy specs by pp of TotalSolids\n\nSwitch the cross-source dairy comparison metric from\n`relative_diff_percent` (% of the larger value) to\n`solids_fraction_diff_pp` (|a/ts_a - b/ts_b| × 100), so each\ndiscrepancy reflects per-gram-of-solids impact on a recipe rather\nthan degenerating on near-zero values.\n\nUpdate all 13 `compare_specs_*` test ceilings, comments, and\nsnapshots accordingly, and add an Energy explainer to\n`COMPARABLE_DAIRY_KEYS` covering the wider intrinsic range of\nkcal/g-of-solids values.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-27T16:27:25-04:00",
