          "id": "3a4f68c34cd0834f14bba36c2f601a688693456c",
          "message": "feat(ts): add short/long str helpers for key types\n\nAdd `compKeyAsShortStr`, `compKeyAsLongStr`, `ratioKeyAsShortStr`,\n`ratioKeyAsMedStr`, `ratioKeyAsLongStr`, `fpdKeyAsShortStr`,\n`fpdKeyAsMedStr`, `fpdKeyAsLongStr`, `propKeyAsShortStr`, and\n`propKeyAsLongStr` to `optimizations.ts`, each backed by a\npre-built map to avoid repeated JS<->WASM boundary crossings.\n\nAdd unit tests in `optimizations.test.ts` verifying each new\nfunction matches its underlying WASM function for all enum\nvariants.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>",
