          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c83d32e3497ef874699b7402182d8d73cee10afe",
          "message": "Make wall-clock-sensitive e2e tests more resilient\n\n* Increase the fetch API request delay in 'RecipeResources' tests in\n  order to allow wider margins for the inner thresholds, to absorb\n  slowdowns from test UI driving and parallel-worker contention.\n* Add an optional `timeout` arg to `expectRecipeElementsToHaveExpected`,\n  which is passed down to the Playwright `expect` calls. The sensitive\n  tests need timeouts longer than the default 5000ms, e.g. 12 seconds.\n* Use `waitForRecipeEditorHydrationReady` in `pasteRecipeIntoEditor`,\n  similarly to how it's used to fix the issue in `fillRecipeIntoEditor`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-09T21:57:02-04:00",
          "tree_id": "7a342ea26ec46b1e3f8490371bb7f4b8ddd3dd03",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/c83d32e3497ef874699b7402182d8d73cee10afe"
