          "id": "3d1559db95443c51c5f669d6a489b5e19b693cc9",
          "message": "Make recipe paste/fill test more slow-resilient\n\n* Make recipe paste/fill e2e tests more resilient to UI driving\n  slowdowns and parallel-worker contention, by increasing the default\n  `expect` timeout, from 5000ms to 12000ms, passed through the util.\n* Add optional `timeout` arg to `pasteRecipeAndWaitForUpdate` and\n  `fillRecipeAndWaitForUpdate`, passed to underlying `expect` calls.",
