          "id": "b48af27f253f11fd11b0af323cac12a78cbafb36",
          "message": "Introduce `CompKey::NetPAC`, `RatioKey::AbsNetPAC`\n\n* Introduce `CompKey::NetPAC`, which is `TotalPAC` - `HF`, and\n  `RatioKey::AbsNetPAC`, which is `NetPAC / Water`. `NetPAC` is special\n  as it is the only `CompKey` that can go negative if `HF` > `TotalPAC`.",
