          "distinct": true,
          "id": "240e80c94393a1c72304dcd96ae5b6e01517b896",
          "message": "Group every key-filter popup by hierarchy\n\nAdd an optional orderKeys prop to KeyFilterSelect; when supplied, the\nCustom-filter checklist is reordered into hierarchy order, roll-up rows\nemphasized and members indented by depth. Absent the prop, it renders\nflat as before.\n\nA useOrderKeys hook folds the global Group-by read and the once/repeat\nplumbing into one callback, which each view threads to both its display\nand its KeyFilterSelect popup. PropertiesView, WatchersView and\nPropertiesChartView pass it bound to PropKey; CompositionBreakdownView\nuses a groupEnabledCompKeys adapter that bridges CompKey through the\nPropKey-keyed hierarchy via a shared inverse map.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-12T03:36:07-04:00",
          "tree_id": "b052cd6b8850c6807f61c649350d5cd4e527868d",
