          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b3e8077dead190afeae78e9165ced2c652ade13c",
          "message": "Adopt LightRecipe/balance tuple TS aliases\n\nReplace hand-rolled [string, number][], [PropKey, number][], and\n[PropKey, Priority][] tuples with the named LightRecipe, LightRecipeLine,\nBalanceTargets, and BalancePriorities aliases across both packages.\n\nMove LightRecipe/LightRecipeLine into a dedicated light-recipe.ts module\n(re-exported via the barrel); BalanceTargets/BalancePriorities stay in\nbalancing.ts. Drop the app's duplicate LightRecipe alias in favor of the\npackage export.\n\nBehavior-neutral: these are structural aliases, so the casts they wrap\nare unchanged. PropKey is `number | string-literals`, so the watchers\nbalance helpers cast `propKey as PropKey` and normalize keys via String().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
