          "distinct": true,
          "id": "22371932addfd3d13fd16bd58b986e5d45cac98a",
          "message": "Add curated typical balancing key subset\n\nAdd get_typical_balancing_keys, a hand-picked subset that\nadequately recovers most mixes, and rename get_balanceable_keys\nto get_all_balanceable_keys.\n\nAdd get_recipe_entry_by_id for embedded recipe lookups, and a\ntest asserting the typical keys recover the full reference\ncomposition (only the stabilizer-gum breakdown drifts). Widen\nREF_LIGHT_RECIPES to cover all embedded recipes.\n\nBench validate_balancing_targets over both the all-keys and\ntypical-keys target sets.\n\n* Expose WASM-compatible wrappers for `get_all_balanceable_keys` and\n  `get_typical_balancing_keys`, returning enums serialized as strings,\n  directly usable as `PropKey`s on the TS-side. Also include TS-side\n  counterparts that conveniently do the `as PropKey[]` cast.\n* Add TS-side `validate_*` benches with all-keys and typical-keys.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
