          "id": "275a90669186cb23e89c8e59e32c1b481276b357",
          "message": "Update `/sci-cream` & `/app` pnpm deps to latest\n\n* Switch the `rollupTypes` config to `bundleTypes` in `vite.config.ts`,\n  required by the \"vite-plugin-dts\" update from major varion v4 to v5.\n* Add \"@microsoft/api-extractor\" depend, required by \"vite-plugin-dts\".\n* Replace `[scrollbar-gutter:stable]` with `scrollbar-gutter-stable`.\n* Replace deprecated \"remark-slug@8\" with replacement \"rehype-slug\".\n  Switch `markdown.ts` to use \"remark-rehype\" -> \"rehype-slug\" ->\n  \"rehype-stringify\", removing @ts-expect-error for version mismatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
