          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6db6a84c789a93be1fbc617e23375504401c340c",
          "message": "Reconcile Nielsen-Massey flavourings with labels\n\nSet the AlcoholSpec sugars/fat for the nine Nielsen-Massey extracts,\npastes, and powder so each reproduces its published per-serving\nnutrition label under a density estimate plus FDA rounding; a few\nlabels are alcohol-limited and documented as such.\n\nAdd constants::density::oils with cited flavor-oil densities used to\nestimate extract serving mass. Add a label-reconciliation test suite\nunder a new tests/embedded home for tests whose subject is the\nembedded-data product, sharing a seeded EMBEDDED_DB lifted into\ntests/assets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
