          "distinct": true,
          "id": "bd502308e80d40c75d1ca964b45bd3be2c4729e8",
          "message": "Split balancing into keys/validate/solve modules\n\nThe single balancing.rs had grown to ~3,900 lines. Split it into a\nbalancing/ directory following the crate's mod.rs-is-declarations-only\nconvention:\n\n- keys.rs    BalanceKey, target_row_coeff/rhs, key catalogs\n- validate.rs Severity, BalancingIssue, BalancingReport,\n             validate_balancing_targets and all feasibility checks\n- solve.rs   Weighting, Priority, balance_compositions, the solvers\n             and the weighted-system assembly machinery\n- tests.rs   the test module, moved verbatim\n- mod.rs     module doc, declarations, and re-exports only\n\ntarget_row_coeff/rhs move into keys. Weighting and Priority, the two\nrow-weighting knobs, live together in solve; validate names Priority\nonly in its signatures (it inspects priority keys, never the value).\nSix items become pub(crate) for test and cross-module access. All\nfunction bodies are unchanged.\n\nThe 15 balancing snapshots move alongside their test file (insta\nresolves snapshots/ relative to the source file); their asserted\nbodies are identical, only the source: header changed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
