          "message": "Use `roundToComp*ValueFormat` for ref -> target\n\n* Use `roundToCompositionValueFormat` when setting a target value from a\n  reference recipe, so that the target matches `formatCompositionValue`\n  and the resulting values can match exactly, as they are displayed.\n* Implement `calculateCompositionFormatDelta`, which calculates a delta\n  from values roundes via the above method, to show no delta if match.",
