          "distinct": true,
          "id": "fbc8e472adbc0cb9d65eec267e50855062dab959",
          "message": "Add includePlusSign to formatCompositionValue\n\nExtend `padToFixedDecimalPosition`, `formatThousands`, and\n`formatCompositionValue` with an `includePlusSign` flag that prepends\n`+` to positive values. Fix `formatThousands`'s exact-integer branch\nto use the signed `Math.round(num) / 1000` so negative k-suffix values\nrender with a `-` sign. Propagate the flag through\n`applyQtyToggleAndFormat`.\n\nAdd tests covering negative k-suffix values and the full\n`includePlusSign` behaviour across all formatting branches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-27T20:16:48-04:00",
          "tree_id": "7f45c0980dcf2b3d3441ed7e484f9bb78b4365fc",
