          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f6ca0a68579b8d123a66057f87add7c09677ad02",
          "message": "Expose balance total_amount over WASM bridge\n\nThread an optional total_amount through Bridge::balance_recipe and the\nRecipe::balance WASM wrapper (previously hardcoded to None), forwarding\nto Recipe::balance so JS can set the balanced recipe's total mass. When\nomitted, the current total is still inferred, keeping it constant.\n\nCover the new parameter with Rust and TS bridge tests: an explicit total\nscales the result while still hitting the composition targets, and the\nomitted/undefined case keeps the current total.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-03T12:19:31-04:00",
          "tree_id": "5232d9ecb3b195f77f4c15fe7361471aff6dae38",
