          "id": "7ee149f67099ae83e6c29f29163bd9c94fc724a6",
          "message": "Slightly modify sweetened condensed, add more ing\n\n* Slightly modify 'USDA Sweetened Condensed Milk' to use the SR Legacy\n  reference + sucrose content from the Foundation reference, at 44.8%.\n* Add a TODO to review this estimate; it's the ref for other estimates.\n* Modify Eagle Brand sweetened condensed milk ingredient to calculate\n  sucrose content from this new estimate, and fix reference citations.\n* Add new cream, milk, and sweetened condensed milk ingredients, in\n  preparation for upcoming 'Ice Cream Science' reference recipes.",
