          "message": "Persist source filter; reverse version order\n\nPersist the All/Built-in/Saved source filter in EntitySearch via\nusePersistedState keyed off the id prop, so /ingredients and /recipes\nremember the selection across mounts. Degrades to plain useState when\nno id is given.\n\nList recipe versions newest-first in the version dropdown, keeping\neach option's index into the versions array intact.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
