          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d7c5d9e6c9d967cff236ec95252bc345444a0f35",
          "message": "Fix recipe balancing gate, orphans, auto-balance\n\nTreat a recipe as balanceable when it has valid ingredients, not only\nnonzero mass, so zero/unset quantities can be balanced and validated.\nAdd `recipeHasIngredients` and switch the balancing gates off\n`isRecipeEmpty`, which now also fixes no-quantity ingredients being\nleft out of target validation.\n\nExclude orphan quantities (rows without a valid ingredient) from the\nmix total, outline such quantities in red, and hide their percentage.\n\nOnly manual quantity edits and paste stop auto-balancing; recipe-name,\ningredient add/remove, evaporation, and clear no longer do. Rename\n`onUserEdit` to `onUserQuantityEdit` and re-balance on evaporation\nchange so it stays balanced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-10T15:58:04-04:00",
          "tree_id": "108e369a74b0de23554aeff3e160622007ccc2eb",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/d7c5d9e6c9d967cff236ec95252bc345444a0f35"
