          "id": "e20edd081734192fe131bb165d3ef60d71aa37b4",
          "message": "Move recipe name row into the editor toolbar\n\nA prior change moved the Save and branch buttons out of the toolbar and\ninto the recipe name row. The toolbars visual test screenshots only\n`.toolbar`, so it stopped covering those buttons.\n\nNest the name row inside the single `.toolbar` div as a `basis-full`\nitem so flex-wrap drops it onto its own line. The existing toolbar\nscreenshot then captures the save buttons again, with no separate\nname-row screenshot needed.\n\nRegenerate the 11 recipe-editor toolbar snapshots, now taller for the\nincluded name row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
