          "id": "3b7a7c3a1e1fb7d983f24334c8b2ef29e2e291a1",
          "message": "Complete documentation of `Emulsifiers` and fields\n\n* Complete documentation about emulsifiers, in `comp*::Emulsifiers`.\n* Rename `Stabilizers::egg_yolk_proteins` to `::egg_yolk_solids`.\n* Rework `lecithin` field into several fields to track all egg solids\n  and egg and non-egg derived lecithin separately. New fields:\n    `egg_yolk_lecithin`\n    `egg_yolk_other_solids`\n    `non_egg_lecithin`\n  Total egg solids and total lecithin can be accessed via new methods:\n    `egg_yolk_solids()`\n    `total_lecithin()`\n* Add all known emulsifier strength contants; some are still @todo.\n* Add TODO about moving inline ice cream science documentation to the\n  `docs` section, and referencing those in the previous locations,\n  about adding a `build.rs` to merge .md's and create a TOC, and about\n  refining the knowledge base docs with better peer-reviewed sources.",
