          "message": "Split `FpdGraph` into bare + panel layers\n\nExtracts the line chart into a bare `FpdGraph` element under\n`_elements/charts/`, leaving slot filtering and grid-layout chrome\nin a new `FpdGraphPanel` under `_components/`. The bare element\ntakes a required `main: RecipeSummary` and optional `refs?` so\nsingle-recipe consumers (e.g. recipe search) can use it directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
