          "id": "0625085c5795365037bc28f628698093d6a37d01",
          "message": "Split `MixPropertiesChart` into bare/view/panel\n\nExtracts the bar chart into a bare `PropertiesBarChart` element\nunder `_elements/charts/`, a `PropertiesChartView` with the\n`KeyFilterSelect` toolbar, and a `PropertiesChartPanel` carrying\nthe slot filter and grid-layout chrome. The bare and view layers\ntake a required `main: RecipeSummary` plus optional `refs?`, so\nsingle-recipe consumers (e.g. recipe search) can drop in the view\ndirectly with the toolbar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
