          "message": "Rename panel `id` attributes to match class names\n\nRenames the calculator panels' top-level DOM ids, their internal\nsub-element ids, and the visual-regression screenshot filenames\nto line up with the new panel component names:\n\n  recipe-grid          -> recipe-editor-panel\n  mix-properties-grid  -> properties-panel\n  ing-composition-grid -> composition-breakdown-panel\n  mix-properties-chart -> properties-chart-panel\n  fpd-graph            -> fpd-graph-panel\n\nThe `CompositionBreakdown` sub-table ids (formerly tied to the\n`IngredientCompositionGrid` name) move to:\n\n  ing-quantity-table    -> composition-breakdown-recipe-table\n  ing-composition-table -> composition-breakdown-table\n\nUpdates unit tests, e2e selectors, visual-regression\n`page.locator(...)` calls, screenshot string arguments, and\n`makeFilename(...)` prefixes accordingly. Snapshot `.png` files\nunder `components.spec.ts-snapshots/` are renamed via `git mv` so\nthe visual baseline tracks across the move.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-11T12:51:39-04:00",
          "tree_id": "513cf8685eb5472f6291465d33dbbed11cbf7803",
