          "distinct": true,
          "id": "efa532eaff014b7b0f876add833ee30ff8bde512",
          "message": "Introduce `RecipeSearch` and `recipes/page.tsx`\n\n* Introduce `RecipeSearch` with functionality to search through embedded\n  recipes as well as optional user-saved ones. It allows searching by\n  recipe name, author, or ingredient. When a recipe is clicked, it\n  displays the recipe via `RecipeTable`, and the mix properties via\n  `PropertiesView`. It also shows any 'comments' in the recipe data.\n* Introduce a non-placeholder `recipes/page.tsx` that instantiates a\n  `RecipeSearch` and passes a prop to load a recipe into local storage\n  and navigates to the calculator page at the loaded recipe slot.\n* Introduce `autoLink` in new `lib/text.tsx` to wrap each URL in text\n  in an `<a>` tag, used to add links to recipe/ingredient comments.\n* Add visual regression tests for the new `/recipes` page and elements.\n* Add support for `RecipeTable` to highlight invalid ingredient names.\n* Add stub `fetchAllUserSavedRecipes` to test red highlight component of\n  `RecipeTable` and loading of user-defined saved ingredients.\n\n@todo This does not yet work on mobile viewports.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-11T23:20:51-04:00",
          "tree_id": "29096b278365a9740d50abf67bb0d4194c5e6c09",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/efa532eaff014b7b0f876add833ee30ff8bde512"
