          "id": "9c97a1167213695520a5c9df08fa57faf64340bd",
          "message": "Overhaul visual viewport assets and layout tests\n\n* Overhaul desktop viewport assets, adding a `VIEWPORT_DESKTOP_DEFAULT`\n  that is Playwright's \"Desktop Chrome\", a 1080p screen but with a much\n  smaller viewport. Also remove 2160p viewports, since 1440p doubles as\n  2160p at a 150% scaling (typical for 27-32\" 4K monitors).\n* Subtract a veritcal and horizontal offset to account for browser UI.\n* Change layout tests to test all viewports for /calculator, /recipes,\n  and a blog post page. More tests can be added for future pages.\n* Modify recipe-search tests to remove some redundant test cases, as\n  well as to add tests for the details panel scrolled to show comments.",
