          "id": "33f980a076a10923f8017b720158bd081fbbc68d",
          "message": "Add CompositionTable + CompositionView elements\n\nSingle-ingredient analogue of the PropertiesTable/View pair: takes a\nWASM Composition (rather than per-recipe MixProperties) and renders one\ng/100g value per CompKey. Zero values render as empty cells, matching\nthe rest of the app's convention via applyQtyToggle's short-circuit.\n\nCompositionView wraps the bare table with a KeyFilterSelect toolbar\n(All / NonZero / Custom) but skips the QtyToggleSelect: with no\nrecipe context, only the Composition mode is meaningful.\n\nTests cover the bare table's structure, label rendering, zero-handling,\nand the view's toolbar wiring and KeyFilter integration.\n\nPrepares for the /ingredients search page, which will use\nCompositionView in its detail panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-13T17:08:39-04:00",
          "tree_id": "04f80d8f198500d32d5236d7c9443452d818d128",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/33f980a076a10923f8017b720158bd081fbbc68d"
