          "id": "4bccbb38653733e3f69cdcda4e59692bdd5a3f6d",
          "message": "Persist calculator layout to localStorage\n\nSave the user's react-grid-layout customizations to localStorage\non every change and rehydrate them on mount. A version + panel-key\nfingerprint is stored alongside; mismatches fall back to defaults,\nso adding/removing a panel auto-discards stale layouts.\n\nAdd a \"Reset layout\" button in the Header (shown only on\n/calculator) that clears storage and notifies the page via a small\ncustom-event bridge — no reload, no shared context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-17T00:27:45-04:00",
