          "distinct": true,
          "id": "69f6df302be846c15df6d5a9ec3898bece802f70",
          "message": "Add versioning to saved recipes\n\nSave multiple snapshots per recipe with per-version comments and\noptional labels. The new `recipe_versions` table holds snapshots\nkeyed by `(recipe_id, version)` and cascades on recipe deletion.\nThe `recipes` table now carries a serial id plus a unique\nconstraint on `(user, name)`.\n\nServer actions split into create/update/delete per recipe and per\nversion, plus rename. Every mutating action verifies the recipe\nbelongs to the calling user before touching version rows.\n\nRecipe search groups all versions of a recipe into one list item;\nthe detail panel adds a version dropdown (when >=2), per-version\ncomments and load, and a per-version delete alongside the\nwhole-recipe delete.\n\nRecipe editor tracks the loaded version via `savedRef` and a\nname+rows baseline. Save updates the loaded version (renaming\nfirst if the name was edited); Save-as-new-version creates\nv_max+1. An amber dot and filled save icon signal unsaved edits;\nboth reserve space when clean to avoid layout shift.\n\nSeeds `Chocolate Ice Cream` with two versions so the dev\nenvironment exercises the version selector.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-19T01:43:52-04:00",
          "tree_id": "2d7124da306945199b36e654a462179882164d79",
