          "id": "f281ea1f5504c013b42fdb31bea642f6179f3508",
          "message": "Work around drizzle-kit unique constraint bug\n\ndrizzle-kit introspects composite unique constraint columns in\ncolumn-position order (drizzle-orm#3274). If the schema definition\norder differs, every push issues a spurious DROP + ADD CONSTRAINT\n— prompting about truncation once the table has rows.\n\nFix: reorder `recipes_user_name_uq` columns to match table\ndefinition order (name, user). Document the workaround in\nDEVELOPMENT.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
