          "message": "Add evaporated milk ingredients, more Sealtest\n\n* Add evaporated milk ingredients, including both Carnation branded\n  ones and from the USDA FoodData Central - Survey (FNDDS) database.\n* Add more Sealtest branded milk and cream ingredients from label.\n* Add a new `constants::density::EVAPORATED_MILK`, 15ml -> 16.125g\n* Update visual regression screenshots for the new ingredients.",
