          "id": "422466cace438ce4ecf5bd703993e9685f2995af",
          "message": "Add cross-source composition comparison tests\n\nCompare the same conceptual ingredient across multiple data\nsources (DairySimpleSpec model, USDA, brand labels) to verify\nconsistency and document discrepancies.\n\n- Add `compare_compositions` and `assert_compositions_consistent`\n  test helpers, backed by `insta` snapshots that record per-key,\n  per-pair relative differences between sources.\n- Add `CompCeiling` for loose per-key regression ceilings.\n- Add embedded \"USDA Whole Milk\" ingredient and prefix existing\n  USDA-sourced dairy ingredients with \"USDA \" for clarity.\n- Add `insta` dev-dependency and `snapshots:*` / `install:insta`\n  package.json scripts.\n- Add unit tests covering the new test utilities.\n\n* Update visual regression screenshots to accomodate ingredient changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
