          "message": "Add bundle size benchmark to app CI\n\nTrack per-route gzipped first-load JS, shared framework JS, and total\nstatic asset sizes after `next build`. Results publish via the same\n`github-action-benchmark@v1` flow used by the unit and e2e benches.\nAdds a `bundle_benchmarks` CI job, `pnpm bench:bundle` for local runs,\nand `@next/bundle-analyzer` (run via `pnpm build:analyze`, which builds\nwith webpack since the analyzer does not support Turbopack) for ad-hoc\ninvestigation when a regression is flagged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
