          "distinct": true,
          "id": "76b25c24d2b340724e023d6b01f950107242bd82",
          "message": "Add whey/casein supplement ingredients\n\nAdds seven label-based dairy ingredients spanning whey concentrate\n(MyProtein Impact, ON Gold Standard 100% Whey), whey isolate (Bulk\nBarn 90%, MyProtein Clear, ON Gold Standard 100% Isolate), and casein\n(MyProtein Slow-Release, ON Gold Standard 100% Casein).\n\nON Gold Standard 100% Whey and 100% Casein get DairyLabelSpec\ncomposition tests; the other five are database-only entries with no\ntest mirror, following the pattern set by California Gold Casein.\n\nAdds three compare_specs tests (one per supplement category) with\nper-key CompCeiling overrides and snapshot output capturing exact\nrelative diffs across all source pairs.\n\nCites Clarke (2004) alongside Goff & Hartel (2025) for the standard\nwhey/casein protein proportions in MSNF.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
