          "distinct": true,
          "id": "bad85519ebef6087b123cc3b433771ab2f141eb7",
          "message": "Make `ChocolateSpec::cocoa_butter` optional, std\n\n* Make the `ChocolateSpec::cocoa_butter` field optional, calculating it\n  from a standard composition value if unspecified:\n    `STD_COCOA_BUTTER_IN_CACAO_SOLIDS_OF_CHOCOLATE_NON_POWDER`\n* Add tests for chocolate ingredients with unspecified `cocoa_butter`.\n* Add `compare_specs_*` tests for simple & Lindt chocolate ingredients.",
