          "id": "811b2f1a3f35cebb3a2d8db1100b3da7f969b146",
          "message": "Add `Balance` + per-ref fill to Watchers toolbar\n\nWire `Bridge.balance_recipe` from the calculator down through\n`WatchersPanel` and `WatchersView` so users can:\n\n- Click `Balance` to redistribute main-recipe grams to meet all\n  currently-watched CompKey-derived targets (NNLS via WASM).\n- Click `Fill from Ref X` to mirror the watched targets from a\n  reference recipe's mix-property values.\n\nNew `lib/recipe.ts` helpers `makeUpdatedRecipeContext` and\n`makeBalancedRecipeUpdates` centralize safe-index updates and\nbalance-result mapping; `isLightRecipeEligible` extracts the\npredicate shared with `makeLightRecipe`. `lib/util.ts` gains a\nproper `roundToStep` that snaps to step boundaries (not just\ndecimal precision).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
