          "id": "946ea8ec02492ced28f2bbd9025cbe0e6f61266b",
          "message": "Add balancing solver-contract and edge-case tests\n\nCover behavior the scenario tests left implicit: ratio-key exclusion,\nsolver differences, and degenerate systems.\n\n- Unit-test is_ratio_key and get_balanceable_comp_keys\n- Document ratio-key poisoning: nnls yields a NaN achieved value,\n  nalgebra panics (\"Singular value was NaN\")\n- Assert nalgebra can return negative amounts where nnls clamps\n- Add an under-determined (min-norm) sanity case\n- Add a feasible multi-sugar POD/PAC case plus a companion test\n  proving all three sugars are individually load-bearing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
