          "id": "b98543a5cd1661351b322d5ca73aa491fd9cb8b5",
          "message": "Add CompKeys for sweeteners, stabilizers, fibers\n\nAdd a CompKey variant for every named polyol (maltitol, sorbitol,\nxylitol), artificial sweetener, individual stabilizer, and dietary\nfiber (inulin, oligofructose), placing each before its category\ntotal to match the existing sugars convention.\n\nEach new key is wired into Composition::get and CompKey::as_med_str,\nmaking the component readable by key and usable as a balancing\ntarget. The \"other\" catch-all fields are intentionally omitted, as\nthey don't name a specific compound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
