          "id": "94240c2dc4d3d0501a2a6d05cefb39bf74fe846d",
          "message": "Add optional total_amount to Recipe::balance\n\nThe new trailing `total_amount: Option<f64>` sets the total grams of\nthe balanced recipe; `None` keeps the recipe's current total, so\nexisting behavior is preserved. The WASM wrappers pass `None`.\n\nRefocus the balance tests on verifying inputs are forwarded to\nbalance_compositions: fold recipe_balance_dairy, the priority test,\nand the important-targets test into one pass-through test, and add a\ntest for the explicit total_amount.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
