          "id": "99c259d2eb0d797a790253c92e18c2353fca9ecd",
          "message": "refactor(sci-cream): DRY key-display and prop-key\n\nReplace nine hand-written *_key_as_*_str WASM functions with a\nmacro_rules! table; same for the nine parallel tests.\n\nExtract dispatchPropKey<T> to deduplicate the three-way branch\nacross prop_key_as_*_str and getMixProperty.\n\nAdd propToCompKey / propToRatioKey / propToFpdKey: typed narrowing\nhelpers that convert a PropKey to the specific enum value or throw.\n\nUse propToRatioKey in app isPropKeyMixScope, collapsing the\nisRatioKey check + manual reverse-lookup to a single expression.\n\nAdd unit tests for all three propTo*Key functions.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>",
