          "id": "cfcc61fffed824d92c80c2f77944a176fc90ab09",
          "message": "Unify Select styling, drop the className prop\n\nAll five `Select` consumers now share one style — `text-sm`,\nleft-aligned — applied inside the component, so the per-call-site\n`className` prop is removed. This drops RecipeSelect's `w-fit\ntext-center` and the version/slot pickers' `text-sm` in favour of a\nsingle uniform look that matches the panel toolbars (e.g. KeyFilter's\ncustomize button).\n\nRegenerate the visual snapshots for the new size/alignment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
