          "message": "Make the Select unit helper drive either widget\n\nAdd a listbox branch to the unit-test `Select` helpers alongside the\nnative one, so a call site drives either widget shape. This lets the\nshared `Select` swap to Headless UI without touching the helpers or\nthe tests. The e2e helpers were already dual, in the base\nrefactoring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
