          "message": "Switch popups to Headless UI Popover\n\nReplace the hand-rolled portal popups in KeyFilterSelect and\nWatcherIssues with a shared PopupPanel wrapping Headless UI's Popover.\nIts Floating UI-backed `anchor` auto-flips and shifts to stay in the\nviewport, fixing the customize popup overflowing the page (and causing\nhorizontal scroll) when the control sits near the right edge on\n/recipes.\n\nHeadless UI also brings outside-click and Escape dismissal — which the\nKeyFilterSelect popup previously lacked — plus focus management and\nARIA wiring, and removes the duplicated anchoring/dismiss boilerplate\nfrom both components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-11T18:33:13-04:00",
