          "id": "cf6225c7cf0a65583fda0743aba382f76111d375",
          "message": "Add a global Group-by grouping toggle\n\nEncode CompKey roll-up hierarchies as an app-wide grouping preference.\nPropertiesView (and later the breakdown, key-filter popup, and charts)\nreads one GroupBy value through a GroupByProvider/useGroupBy context,\npersisted to localStorage, so grouping is configured once for the whole\napp rather than per panel toolbar.\n\nSurface it as an icon-only navbar Listbox beside the theme control,\nshown only on data routes, which keeps the panel toolbars at two\ncontrols. The properties table renders roll-up headings with\ndepth-indented, emphasized rows, with supporting unit and visual tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
