          "id": "30f3c5973b30dc8291630ca862f553e84b906455",
          "message": "Thread FastComposition through balancing\n\nThe balancing validation and solve paths read the same palette\ncompositions many times via Composition::get, a 77-arm match that\nrecomputes solids aggregates per call. Snapshot each composition\nonce into a FastComposition and read by array index instead.\n\nvalidate_balancing_targets builds the snapshot before its nested\naffectability and ratio-band scans (the O(targets^3) multi-ratio\ncheck dominates); balance_with_reweighting builds it for the\naffectability filter and matrix assembly (run up to twice).\n\nThe internal value readers are now generic over CompositionValues,\nso callers and tests can still pass &[Composition] unchanged.\n\nMeasured (criterion): validate(all_keys) 139 ms -> 0.8 ms (~172x),\nvalidate(typical_keys) 993 us -> 70 us (~14x), balance_compositions\n~101 us -> ~86 us (-15%).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-15T21:41:41-04:00",
          "tree_id": "b6cadd56c186b5495dd1f5dd0044995b9d3595b5",
