          "id": "f632b1f0b2479b1b56f8efb835b9c5ca1da4b04c",
          "message": "Persist toolbar select state to localStorage\n\nAdds `usePersistedState<T>`, a hydration-safe drop-in for `useState`\nthat reads from localStorage on mount (via a `mountedRef` guard so the\ndefault never clobbers a stored value) and writes on every subsequent\nchange. Three colocated hooks wrap it for the three select types:\n`useQtyToggleState`, `useKeyFilterState`, and `useRecipeIdxState`.\n\nA `leafKey(root, suffix)` helper derives `\"${root}:${suffix}\"` storage\nkeys from a per-consumer `persistKey` root, keeping key derivation in\none place. `isValidSlotStore` and `slotFromParam` are extracted to\n`recipe-select.tsx` for shared slot validation and URL param parsing.\n\nEach panel and search consumer passes a distinct `persistKey` root so\nviews never share storage. `urlSlot` in `RecipeEditor` bypasses storage\nentirely when `?slot=N` is present. `LoadAction` now persists its\ntarget slot. Watcher targets and priorities migrate from hand-rolled\neffects to `usePersistedState`; the selected-prop key now derives from\nthe panel's `persistKey` root.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
