          "id": "53b3f82ec2381512ec2eb138ffa9c258d1fd1db8",
          "message": "Add basic support for calculating mix density\n\n* Add density constants for all mono and disaccharides in `constants`.\n* Introduce `MixDensityParams` and `mixture_density` which attempts to\n  estimate the density of a mix from its ethanol, water, sugar, fat, and\n  other solids content. It uses the density of sucrose for all sugars,\n  takes the fat density as an input, and a rough guess for other solids.\n* This is preliminary work with minimal validation, it will be refined\n  later when more reference densities are added to compare against.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-19T15:48:19-04:00",
          "tree_id": "ada227b63d26704df382926455f421494d926841",
