          "distinct": true,
          "id": "dbc5fb0885e2f038a0b3661c3825b8417bb59540",
          "message": "Remove dairy density consts with tables + poly fit\n\n* Remove the `MILK_2`, `MILK_3_5`, `CREAM_40`, `EVAPORATED_MILK`, etc.\n  consts with single `DAIRY_DENSITIES_BY_FAT` table from Goff & Hartel.\n* Use a quadratic polynomial fit over that table to re-implement\n  `dairy_milliliters_to_grams` with a smooth density curve over fat.\n* Also add `DAIRY_INGREDIENTS` table from Goff & Hartel, with Fat, MSNF,\n  Sucrose, Protein, and Density. Unused, will serve as ref for tests.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-19T19:38:47-04:00",
