          "id": "b9314eb5a5dcd156776307b9563772f82815e65c",
          "message": "Add MSNF/sucrose-aware dairy density model\n\nExtend dairy density estimation beyond fat content to support\nevaporated, condensed, and sweetened dairy, keyed on fat, MSNF, and\nsucrose.\n\n- Add dairy_density() linear model (DAIRY_DENSITY_COEFFS) fit over\n  DAIRY_INGREDIENTS, merging two inconsistent rows into one.\n- Split the fat-only path into fresh_dairy_density() and the\n  dairy_ml_to_g() volume conversion.\n- Generalize mixture_density() so sugar, fat, and other_solids each\n  carry their own density; add dairy::MILK_FAT and dairy::MSNF.\n- Extract STD_MINERALS_IN_{MSNF,WS,CASEIN} constants.\n- Source the milk fat density citation (ref 62); fix references 34,\n  55-61.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
