          "id": "499c1f261d095108d50aed99c3867ee58629fa64",
          "message": "Move compare_specs tests to embedded home\n\nThe cross-source `compare_specs_*` suites lived in the `tests` blocks\nof specs/dairy.rs and specs/chocolate.rs, but their subject is the\nembedded data product, not those spec types. Relocate them beside the\nreconciliation suites under tests/embedded/compare_specs/, as\ntop-level test files matching that layout.\n\nThe shared `source_str_to_comp` mapper joins its harness siblings\n(`KeyCeiling`, `assert_compositions_consistent`, `compare_compositions`)\nin tests::util, deduplicating the per-file copies. Each category keeps\nits own `COMPARABLE_*_KEYS` list.\n\nThe 21 insta snapshots move with the suites, renamed to the new module\npath and with their `source:` metadata repointed to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
