          "id": "24f5cca56d77435e254fadc5de962019c3ec638a",
          "message": "Generate field-update methods via macro\n\nReplace the repeated per-field field-update methods across the\ncomposition module with a `field_update_methods!` declarative macro\nthat stamps identical `const fn` + `#[must_use]` methods, with the\nsame doc convention, into each impl block.\n\nConverted 16 structs (17 invocations). Alcohol (single field) stays\nhand-written to avoid clippy::needless_update from `..self`, and\nSimpleProteins keeps `from_total` (no setter). No API, behavior, or\ndependency changes; existing field-update/field-count tests validate\neach conversion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
