          "id": "41b199afc3f4791e3fb2bb8bb70074cefe9b5b3d",
          "message": "Redesign properties chart with range-meter\n\nReplace the error-bar whiskers and grouped reference bars with a\nrange-meter overlay drawn by a Chart.js plugin: a soft acceptable-range\nband behind a single status-colored bar per property, with reference\nrecipes as horizontal tick markers. Switch from the generic\nbarWithErrorBars chart to the typed <Bar>, dropping the\nchartjs-chart-error-bars dependency.\n\nNo-range bars now render a lighter neutral gray and reference ticks use\nthe primary-text color; port the same scheme to WatcherCard (lighter\ngray status rail, primary-color reference ticks).\n\nRemove the chart title and cap the y-axis just above the tallest drawn\nelement, rounded up to the next multiple of 5, so bands and ticks are\nnever clipped.\n\nUpdate unit tests for the new structure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
