          "id": "951cb66fdda1cecace7118c377810e569342d412",
          "message": "Add ingredient lock toggle to balancer UI\n\nWire the crate's balancing lock feature into the app. A per-row\nlock toggle in the recipe editor pins an ingredient at its current\namount; the balancer holds it fixed and solves the rest around it.\nA lock-all toggle in the totals row pins or frees every row at once.\n\n- recipe.ts: IngredientRow.locked flag, makeBalanceLocks (emits\n  [lightIndex, { Amount }] locks), locked-row preservation across\n  a balance, and lockedRows localStorage persistence (kept out of\n  the clipboard string).\n- recipe.tsx: per-row Lock/LockOpen toggle (hidden until row hover,\n  always shown when locked) plus a totals-row lock-all control,\n  sharing an isLockable predicate. Muted states dim the button\n  rather than recoloring it.\n- watchers.tsx: pass locks through validate_recipe_targets and\n  balance_recipe, keyed into the auto-balance effect. Drop a dead\n  text-secondary class from the toggle buttons.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-08T17:15:30-04:00",
          "tree_id": "a103c2b8c3f5e50e0617ab13f220b00ecc57b03f",
