          "distinct": true,
          "id": "ecaae1187288b16dcb045872cb76ea5637bb0c57",
          "message": "Add water evaporation as a recipe attribute\n\nModel cooking water loss as a first-class `Recipe.evaporation` (grams),\nso recipes that list pre-cook ingredients report correct post-evaporation\ncomposition and mix properties.\n\n- Composition::evaporate scales solids up as water is removed.\n- Recipe threads evaporation through composition/mix-property calc and\n  balancing; balancing injects a synthetic locked pure-water line.\n- Recipe::deevaporate balances an equivalent no-evaporation recipe to the\n  post-evaporation composition over all balanceable keys.\n- validate_balancing_targets takes the evaporation fraction and skips\n  palette-feasibility checks when evaporation is present.\n- WASM Bridge gains evaporation params plus deevaporate_recipe; TS\n  RecipeEntry gains an optional evaporation field.\n- Collapse the two Ice Cream Science chocolate entries into one recipe\n  with evaporation: 150.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-09T02:58:34-04:00",
          "tree_id": "eac1e2dc3ab54734ae37329422f8729f002e3c4e",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/ecaae1187288b16dcb045872cb76ea5637bb0c57"
