          "message": "Add Ice Cream Science recipes and vanilla pod\n\nAdd seven Ice Cream Science recipes: Sweet Cream, Pistachio, Roasted\nHazelnut, Roasted Almond, Vanilla Bean Ice Cream, Vanilla Bean Gelato,\nand Egg-free Vanilla Bean Ice Cream.\n\nAdd the Vanilla Bean Pod flavouring the vanilla recipes reference, along\nwith its Ramachandra & Ravishankar (2000) literature reference [^71].\n\nAlso reword the Chocolate recipe comment for clarity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
