          "id": "1ddf52b026bea64b3e30097765d46b94fbf542cd",
          "message": "Freeze checklist panes, hide total when narrow\n\nWrap the weighing checklist in a height-bounded scroll region so the\nheader and the ingredient column freeze against it while recipe columns\nscroll. Bounding the height keeps `overflow-y` from promoting to `auto`,\nwhich would unstick the header.\n\nDrop the ingredient column's greedy full-width truncation for a bounded\nmin/max width, so scrolling reveals long names instead of clipping them.\nHide the batch total below the `sm` breakpoint, where the per-recipe\ncells carry the amounts and the column is not worth the horizontal space.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
