          "id": "c491566b759f154b74fd1b066e75d172d6c63d2e",
          "message": "Group src/lib modules into feature subdirectories\n\nMove clustered lib modules out of the flat src/lib root (23 -> 11\ntop-level modules) into feature subdirectories:\n\n- hooks/       use-checklist-state, use-element-size,\n               use-persisted-state, use-reset-on-change\n- batch/       batch, batch-builder, batch-colors, batch-share\n- recipe/      recipe, recipe-share\n- resources/   session-resources, wasm-resources\n\nFilenames are unchanged; only the @/lib/... import prefixes move.\nGeneric helpers (data, local-storage, url-payload, util, ...) stay\nat the root. Update CLAUDE.md's directory-organization notes.\n\nAlso alias the remaining relative imports in non-test source files\n(e.g. ./select -> @/app/_elements/selects/select).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
