          "id": "e868cf386152178c1dce0d900e2f84d74c630233",
          "message": "Fix Qty column shift between empty/filled recipe\n\nThe Qty columns' widths were narrower than their filled content, so\nthe table's auto layout grew them once numbers appeared, nudging the\ncolumns sideways between an empty and a filled recipe.\n\nWiden the header widths to fit a 4-digit total (the common case) so\nthe layout stays put; larger totals still grow the column and display\nin full. Keep w- rather than min-w-: min-w- lets Qty (g) balloon into\nthe max-w-0 Ingredient column.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
