          "id": "1e84d79f0be1d21be9786288ae9cee903af86f97",
          "message": "Fix Total text shift when lock-all button appears\n\nThe total cell centered \"Total\" in a flex-1 span — i.e. within the\nspace left after the lock-all button. That button renders only on the\nmain recipe with a lockable row, so \"Total\" jumped when switching to a\nreference slot or when the first valid ingredient appeared.\n\nLay the cell out as a grid with equal 1fr side tracks and an empty\nleft spacer, so \"Total\" is centered against the full cell whether or\nnot the button is shown — matching the read-only RecipeTable.\n\nUpdate the affected recipe-editor visual snapshot to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
