          "id": "0a39e03155331cc32633c8cbe01dd3560f112e71",
          "message": "Fix `WatcherCard` delta and ref-row layout\n\n- Compute ref delta as main − ref so the sign reflects how the\n  main recipe differs from the reference, not the other way.\n- Render an invisible placeholder row when a ref recipe is\n  non-empty but lacks a value for the watched key, so card\n  heights stay aligned across siblings.\n- Hoist `goToPageAndPasteRecipes` to shared e2e utils and\n  expand `WatcherCard` / `WatchersView` visual coverage across\n  recipe subsets.\n- In the new `WatchersView` tests, switch to `KeyFilter.Custom`\n  after navigation so the injected selection drives what's\n  shown, instead of being filtered out by `KeyFilter.Auto`.\n- Rename `watcher-card.spec.ts` to `watchers.spec.ts` to match\n  its broader scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
