          "id": "36d584eff0ef5090e9338aeb43e881e9017912a7",
          "message": "Add subset-sum dominance check to balancing\n\nAdd AdditiveDominanceViolation, the subset-sum generalization of\nthe pairwise dominance warning: when several \"part\" targets whose\ncompositions sum under a \"whole\" key in every ingredient have\ntargets summing above the whole's, no non-negative mix can satisfy\nthem all. Palette-derived, with no hardcoded key relationships.\n\nThe accumulation is greedy: sound (never a false positive) but not\nexhaustive. Drop Copy from BalancingIssue (the new variant carries\na Vec<CompKey>) and switch the display impl to `match self`.\nExtract a shared is_checkable_target helper from the pairwise check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
