          "distinct": true,
          "id": "dafeaace272b63818ae7c949973eea3470b0da8f",
          "message": "Unify CompKey aggregate naming and labels\n\nAggregate CompKey variants were named inconsistently: ten carried a\n`Total` prefix while Fiber, Emulsifiers, Stabilizers, and PACtotal did\nnot, despite also being totals.\n\nRename the four odd ones out for a uniform \"Total\" convention:\n  Fiber       -> TotalFiber\n  Emulsifiers -> TotalEmulsifiers\n  Stabilizers -> TotalStabilizers\n  PACtotal    -> TotalPAC\n\nDrop the prefix from every aggregate's as_med_str label so display\nstrings are uniform and compact: the old \"T. Fats\"/\"T. Solids\" style\nbecomes plain \"Fats\"/\"Solids\", matching the already-bare \"Fiber\" and\n\"PAC\". Code stays explicit (Total*) while UI labels stay short.\n\nPersisted watcher selections referencing a renamed key are silently\ndropped on load; the default set is unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
