          "id": "c3cf4958ff764b89fd0c8d331014580337a89a7a",
          "message": "Add tests for balancing priority and ratio keys\n\nClose the test-coverage gap for the recently added per-key\npriority and ratio-key target features.\n\n- Generalize the quality-report harness to run labeled\n  (solver, priorities) columns; add priority-tradeoff and\n  ratio-key snapshots.\n- Priority unit tests: exact weight values, per-level\n  monotonicity, the competing-key tradeoff, and ceteris-paribus\n  mixed levels.\n- Ratio unit tests: estimate_ratio_denominator branches, the\n  reweighting pass, an over-constrained valid-mix guard, and\n  ratio + extensive recovery for water- and fat-denominated keys.\n- Cross-feature test: priority tightens a ratio key.\n- Gate behavioral assertions on a meaningful pp margin, not noise.\n\nDrop an obsolete #[expect(unused_imports)] now that the\nmore_asserts macros are all used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
