          "id": "24bb42b2af139f304c5266cab774093e9e360850",
          "message": "Add '-D warnings' to `run-local-test-suite.sh`\n\n* Add `export RUSTFLAGS=\"-D warnings\"` and `export RUSTDOCFLAGS=\"-D\n  warnings\"` to `sci-cream/scripts/run-local-test-suite.sh`, to avoid\n  build and documentation warnings from slipping through and breaking\n  CI when relying only on this local script before pushing.\n* Move rustfmt/prettier and lint checks earlier in the flow in the\n  `run-local-test-suite.sh` scripts, since these are quick to run, easy\n  to fix, and tend to have trivial failures more often than tests.\n* Add `--no-deps` to 'doc` script in `package.json`, to make build\n  quicker; also add 'doc:examples' with `--examples` flag.\n* Set `RUSTFLAGS=\"-A unstable_features\"` for `pnpm coverage` to allow\n  `pnpm coverage:rust` to run on nightly; similarly to `crate.yml`.",
