          "id": "13158315c9846a3788b0c0e9f05f2e164a4cb482",
          "message": "test(e2e): wait for editor hydration before fill\n\nPrevent a race in the e2e fill path where typing starts while RecipeEditor\nis still hydrating from localStorage. In flaky mobile-chrome runs this could\nleave row 0 with qty filled but name cleared, producing Serving Temp -28.94\ninstead of -14.07.\n\nAdd a hydration-stability check in fillRecipeIntoGrid before entering recipe\nvalues so fill assertions observe a settled UI state.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>",
