          "message": "Add watcher balancing priorities, refine UI\n\n- Add a per-target balancing priority (Normal/High/Critical) via a\n  click-to-cycle chevron marker; forward non-Normal priorities for\n  targeted keys to balance_recipe and persist them to localStorage.\n- Move the target row above the reference rows.\n- Render deltas monochrome (signed but uncolored) instead of red/green.\n- Show the remove (X) button only under the Custom key filter, where\n  removal takes effect; Auto derives keys from a heuristic so it would\n  be a no-op there.\n- Make WatcherCard's priority prop optional, defaulting to Normal.\n- Add a visual test for the remove button's key-filter visibility.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-08T14:37:01-04:00",
          "tree_id": "74f85d809cab705ac5850d8c60e02b7ab6dbf781",
