          "id": "57d2b9e84149c619f918f5026e2b1242c7b7399d",
          "message": "Wire validate_balancing_targets into WASM API\n\nAdd `Bridge::validate_recipe_targets` (inner + WASM wrapper) and\n`wasm::Recipe::validate_targets` exposing `validate_balancing_targets`\nto JS. Returns a serialized `BalancingReport` with all issues (errors\nand warnings); only throws on unknown ingredient.\n\nAdd typed `BalancingIssue` variant exports (`NegativeTargetError`,\n`PriorityWithoutTargetWarning`, etc.) and `BalancingReport` interface\nto `balancing.ts`, along with `getBalancingErrors` / `getBalancingWarnings`\npartition helpers. Cover with Rust unit tests and TS integration tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
