          "message": "Rename the Non-Zero key filter to Active\n\n\"Non-Zero\" was technical and hyphenated. Rename the KeyFilter option\n(member and label) to \"Active\" — keys with a non-zero, finite value\n(excluding zero, NaN, and infinities) — across the views, tests, and the\nvisual spec. The renamed snapshot still needs regenerating to show the\nnew label.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
