          "id": "9ba3a2bc9ed7163cb756f342415a1a677c64fcba",
          "message": "Add balancing issue-report snapshot tests\n\nSnapshot the user-facing validate_balancing_targets report for\nmulti-issue scenarios (malformed inputs, several warnings at once,\nand real recipes), so spurious or unhelpful wording is reviewable\nas a whole. Single-issue cases stay covered by validate_flags_*\nassertions.\n\nAdd a report_balancing_issues helper and lift the shared\nbalance_key_label out of report_balance_quality.\n\nAlso add two #[ignore]d tests documenting validator gaps the\nsnapshots surfaced: a self-dominance \"X exceeds X\" warning on a\nduplicate target key, and an unaffectable warning on a zero target\nfor an absent component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
