          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6bb64052c238d61444e7ae319a26210dba78883b",
          "message": "Add FastComposition value-lookup snapshot\n\nReading a Composition via get(CompKey) is a 77-arm match, and many\narms recompute solids.all() aggregates per call. FastComposition\ncomputes every CompKey value once into a flat array, keyed by\n`key as usize`, turning each later read into an array index (~240x\nfaster per read once built; building is ~one sweep).\n\nAdd a CompositionValues trait (get required, get_ratio defaulted)\nimplemented for both Composition and FastComposition, so lookup-\nheavy code can take &impl CompositionValues. CompKey gains an\nEnumCount derive for the array length, guarded by a contiguity\ntest, alongside a parity test and a fast_composition benchmark.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
