          "message": "Constrain select defaults to supported list\n\nMove supportedKeyFilters/supportedQtyToggles into the hook via const\ngenerics; defaultFilter/defaultValue are now typed as Filters[number]/\nToggles[number] — a mismatched default is a compile error rather than a\nsilent runtime bug. isValid also narrows to the supported subset.\nCall sites thread the returned list to the component, eliminating the\nduplicate literal arrays.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
