          "id": "428d7062c482795d060d41ac82e0ade071b97065",
          "message": "Replace seed conflict twins with OnConflict enum\n\nCollapse the database's seeding API onto an OnConflict { Reject,\nOverwrite } policy passed to seed, seed_from_specs, and a new\nseed_from_embedded_data, plus a clear primitive. This drops the\nunique-only seed_unique_ingredient helper in favour of a single\nseed_ingredient path, and keeps the orchestration of resetting to\nthe embedded baseline and overlaying caller specs out of the crate.\n\nExpose the enum and the new primitives across the WASM database and\nBridge wrappers so JS owns that orchestration, and cover the new\nbehaviour with Rust unit tests plus JS sanity tests. Update the app's\nexisting seed_from_specs caller to pass OnConflict.Reject.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
