          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e09e1da484f354dad35a80bbb906de6cac35adae",
          "message": "Replace flat ABV/ABW ratio with density curve\n\nSwitch Alcohol::from_abv/to_abv to the concentration-dependent\nabv_to_abw/abw_to_abv conversions; the flat ABV_TO_ABW_RATIO\nunder-estimated ABW for concentrated solutions (40% ABV is 33.3%\nABW, not 31.6%). Re-baseline the alcohol, spec, recipe, and\nreference-recipe expectations that shift as a result.\n\nABV is now non-additive under mixing, which the linear balancing\nsolver cannot treat as a direct row. As an interim, drop ABV from\nthe balanceable keys and retarget the typical keys, the boozy\ntest, and the balancing doc example to the additive Alcohol proxy\n(@todos in code); update the affected snapshots. Add a TODO for an\nintensive->extensive translation layer.\n\n* Exclude `Alcohol` instead of `ABV` from the default Watchers keys.\n* Update visual regression snapshots to accomodate the new values.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-19T01:41:17-04:00",
          "tree_id": "b859fdb712091cc9798b8b78adc71b3da287fa0e",
          "url": "https://github.com/ramonrsv/sci-cream/commit/e09e1da484f354dad35a80bbb906de6cac35adae"
