          "id": "88052178a6ec507426c0bfd89fea2dc495ec7436",
          "message": "Route tests through shared embedded-DB utilities\n\nTests across the crate each seeded their own IngredientDatabase from\nembedded data. Point them at the shared `EMBEDDED_DB` static and the\n`get_comp_by_name()` helper in `tests::assets` instead, dropping the\nduplicate `static DB`/`DATABASE` definitions and the `comp_by_name`\nand per-file `source_str_to_comp` wrappers that `get_comp_by_name()`\nnow covers.\n\nFolding the trait-method lookups into `get_comp_by_name()` leaves\n`IngredientGetter` dead in the dairy/chocolate/balancing test\nmodules; drop it and the other now-unused imports.\n\nLeft as explicit constructions: the database tests that validate the\nseeding constructor, the wasm `Bridge::new` site (owns a non-Clone\ndatabase), and the lib.rs doctests (compiled as an external crate).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
