          "id": "bd7653edfb7122c22bdebbd380c4948ea3c11a65",
          "message": "Add delta columns to PropertiesTable\n\nAdd a Delta toggle (Off/Absolute/Relative) to the Properties panel that\ngives each reference recipe an adjacent column showing main − reference,\neither absolute (in the active quantity units) or relative (percent of\nthe reference). Reference value columns are preserved alongside the new\ndelta column; the toggle only appears when a reference recipe is present.\n\nNew `computeDelta` and `computeDeltaAndFormat` helpers reuse the\nexisting quantity-toggle conversion and fixed-width formatting. State\npersists under the `:delta` leaf key, mirroring the QtyToggle pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
