          "message": "Track media and font sizes in bundle benchmark\n\nAdd a \"Total static media (raw)\" metric covering everything under\n.next/static/media (fonts, images, icons). It's uploaded as a separate\ntrack-only CI step, so a new image import shows on the dashboard\nwithout gating the build.\n\nAlso break out a gated \"Total fonts (raw)\" metric. Fonts are on the\npreload critical path and rarely change, so a large regression should\nfail CI like the first-load JS metrics.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
