          "id": "ced6e6c0ec88259e021f64907e7ee055fe602528",
          "message": "Handle evaporation errors in the recipe editor\n\nWrap the mix-property calculation so a sci-cream failure (e.g.\nevaporation exceeding the mix's available water) is caught rather than\ncrashing the render: `mixProperties` falls back to empty and the error\nis recorded in `Recipe.mixError`. The Evap input flags it with a red\noutline, `aria-invalid`, and surfaces the sci-cream message as its\ntooltip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
