          "id": "279c225ec395ef08cf738ea739e789c6961efeb1",
          "message": "Add cross-source compare_specs test for egg yolk\n\nLine up the consolidated default \"Egg Yolk\" against its Clarke, Goff &\nHartel, and USDA Raw reference sources, backstopped by a per-key\nceiling and a review snapshot of the per-key discrepancies. Energy\nneeds a 28 pp override (kcal-per-g-of-solids amplifies the sources'\nfat-content disagreement); all mass keys stay within 5 pp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
