          "distinct": true,
          "id": "cecf7e57b946d2a5869332fb95cd8c1a87be1a16",
          "message": "Make nut/egg/cacao solids sugar-inclusive\n\nCacaoSolids, NutSolids, EggSolids and their SNF keys now report the\nfull ingredient solids including intrinsic sugar (snf), matching the\nkey names; only externally added sugar (in Solids::other) stays\nseparate via TotalSugars.\n\nTotalSNFS still computes the true sugar-free total via all().snfs(),\nbut cocoa/nut/egg are dropped from its hierarchy leaves and it is no\nlonger a residual-free rollup. The structural forest only bounds that\nresidual, so verify_structural_consistency adds an exact identity\ncheck pinning TotalSNFS to the sum of per-source SNFS.\n\nUpdate docs and tests to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-23T00:30:04-04:00",
