          "message": "Test grid resize and sticky table scrolling\n\nAdd functional (e2e) and visual regression coverage for the calculator's\nresizable panels and sticky/pinned table scrolling.\n\n- calculator-sticky.spec.ts: assert the sticky header and pinned columns\n  hold position while the pane scrolls, for the properties,\n  composition-breakdown, and recipe-editor tables (both axes where they\n  apply).\n- calculator-layout.spec.ts: exercise the newly-enabled south (vertical)\n  resize handle on the recipe panel; refactor the resize helper to take\n  an axis.\n- panels.spec.ts: five container-level scroll-state screenshots\n  (properties/breakdown on both axes, recipe-editor vertical); drop the\n  now-redundant \"properties panel - scrolled state\" shot.\n- Add a `recipe-editor-table-pane` testid as a stable scroll-pane hook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
