          "distinct": true,
          "id": "749018ebd6499e5ca3a1f3ac4b754b857192bdec",
          "message": "Fix stale entity selection and version index bugs\n\nEntitySearch held a frozen snapshot of the selected entry, so a data\nrefresh (e.g. after deleting a recipe) left the panel showing a\ndeleted entry. Selection is now a stable per-entry key looked up\nfresh against the current list on every render, so it both drops a\nselection that's gone and keeps a surviving entry's data current.\n\nRecipeDetailPanel's version selector kept a stale index after its own\nversion was deleted, desyncing the dropdown from its options. The\nreset key now folds in the version count, so it resets to the latest\nversion whenever that count changes. Also caps the version Select's\nwidth so an unusually long custom label can't blow out the layout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
