          "id": "780411ea52218dccaaca65512f70fd93495031b1",
          "message": "Add orientation-aware properties bar chart\n\nAuto-rotate the properties bar chart between vertical and horizontal\nbased on its container aspect ratio, so tall/narrow (mobile portrait)\npanels stay readable. A new useElementSize (ResizeObserver) hook drives\nthe switch, with a hysteresis dead band to avoid flip-flop near square;\norientation is derived during render, not in an effect.\n\nThe rangeMeter plugin (bands + reference ticks), bar gradient, scales,\nborderRadius, and tooltip are all mirrored per orientation.\n\nAlso angle the category-axis labels adaptively (0-90 deg) so they use\nless horizontal space when the x axis gets cramped; Chart.js leaves the\ny-axis (horizontal bars) labels flat.\n\nAdd unit tests covering both orientations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-02T22:32:17-04:00",
