          "message": "Add watcher target-management and visibility controls\n\nAdd a toolbar Clear-all and per-card clear-target button, a Set-from-\ncurrent (M) button that seeds targets from the main recipe, and three\ninline toggles to hide/show the range meter, target column, and\nreference values per card. Toggle state persists per-view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
