          "id": "0b60d126a916ed512ae0d55f9d59c84e15204648",
          "message": "Extract RangeMeter primitive from Watcher cards\n\nMove the horizontal meter markup and valueToMeterPct out of\nwatchers.tsx into a new shared range-meter.tsx primitive. The\nWatcher cards now render <RangeMeter> instead of inline markup;\nrendered DOM is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
