          "message": "Limit precision of evaporation error messages\n\nFormat the f64 values interpolated into `InvalidEvaporation` messages\nwith `{:.2}` so they read cleanly instead of dumping full float\nprecision.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
