          "id": "b89eac7e101212a88ca9db90be5f810ba2d8902c",
          "message": "Reorganize app files to match dir conventions\n\nMove JSX out of src/lib and standalone components out of route\ndirectories so files follow the app's layering convention: lib is\nJSX-free .ts, _components holds page composites, _elements holds\nwidgets, and a new _providers/ holds app-wide context providers.\n\n- group-by/session-resources: keep context+hooks in lib as .ts,\n  extract the JSX providers to app/_providers/\n- text.tsx -> _elements/text.tsx\n- make-recipe-view, recipe-share-viewer -> _components/\n- batch-builder: split pure reducers to lib/batch-builder.ts,\n  widget to _elements/tables/batch-builder.tsx\n- recipe-share-viewer: extract makeSharedRecipe to lib/recipe-share.ts\n- web-vitals-mark.ts -> lib/\n- relocate group-by's pure-logic tests to lib/group-by.test.ts\n\nnavbar.tsx stays at the src/app root as the app shell. Document the\nconvention in CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
