          "id": "8593cb2efbbe16af56db42bc18148d7e1a3636cc",
          "message": "Add opt-in version names to saved recipes\n\nSaved recipe versions can now carry a free-form display name (e.g.\n`3.1`, `4.2-b`) alongside the internal integer sequence. The integer\nstays the identity/sort/lookup key; `version_name` holds what a user\nsees once they opt in, and is unique per recipe.\n\n- schema: nullable `version_name` column + partial unique index\n- data: thread `versionName` through the version server actions, with\n  grammar validation and auto-materialization only once a recipe has\n  opted in, so plain integer recipes are unaffected\n- version.ts: shared, dependency-free helpers (grammar, display, and\n  next-name derivation) for both the server layer and the UI\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
